<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Johana</book>
  <para style="h">Johana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Johana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Johana</para>
  <para style="mt">Johana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tîrin Thu a awm, Thu chu Pathian hnênah a awm a, Thu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chu a tîr aṭangin Pathian hnênah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engkim amah hmanga siam a ni a; thil siam rêng rêng amah tel lo chuan eng mah siam a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amahah chuan nunna a awm a, chu nunna chu mihringte tâna êng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />êng chu thim zîngah a lo êng a, thimin chu chu a ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathianin mi pakhat a rawn tîr a, a hming chu Johana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chu êng thu chu hriattîr tûra lo kal a ni, mi zawng zawngin a thuchah chu an hriata an rinna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chu êng chu a ni lo, êng thu chu hriattîr tûra lo kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu êng chu êng tak tak, khawvêla lo kala, mi tin rawn êntu chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawvêlah a awm a, amah hmanga khawvêl chu siam a ni a, khawvêlin amah chu a hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ram ngeiah a lo kal a, ama miten an lo lâwm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat erawh chuan an lo lâwm a, amah an ring a, an hnênah Pathian fate nih theihna a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng mite chu thisen hrin an ni lo va, tisa duhzâwnga hrin pawh an ni lo va, mipa duhzâwnga hrin an ni hek lo, Pathian hrin an ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, thu chu tisaah a lo chang a, kan zîngah a lo awm ta a. A ropuizia kan hmu, Pa Fa mal neih chhun ropuina chu, khawngaih leh thutakin a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Johanan a chanchin a hril a, “ ‘Ka hnunga lo kal tûr chu keimah aiin a ropui zâwk,’ ka tih kha he mi hi a ni, ka awm hmaa awm tawh a ni si a,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A khawngaihna famkim aṭangin khawngaihna kan dawng ṭheuh, khawngaihna hlîr khawngaihna hlîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dân chu Mosia hmanga pêk a ni a, khawngaihna leh thutak erawh chu Isua Krista zâra lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu man Pathian an hmu ngai lo va, Pa Fa neih chhun, a ângchhûnga awm chuan a chanchin a hriattîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa Juda-ten, “Tu nge i nih?” tia zâwt tûra Puithiamte leh Levia chite an tirh laia Johana thu lo sawi chu hei hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zêp lovin, “Kei zawng Krista chu ka ni lo,” tiin chiang takin a inpuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“A nih leh tu nge i nih le? Elija i ni em?” tiin an zâwt leh a. Ani chuan, “Ka ni lo,” a ti a. “Zâwlnei kha i ni em?” an ti a; “Ni lo,” tiin a chhâng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Min tîrtute kan chhân theih nân tu nge i nih min hrilh teh, i chanchin eng nge sawi tûr i neih?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan, “ ‘Lalpa kawng tingîl rawh u,’ tia, Thlalêra au aw, zâwlnei Isaian a sawi kha ka ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûng mite chu Farisai-te tirh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Krista tal, Elija tal, Zâwlnei tal chu i nih si loh chuan, engati nge i baptis si le?” tiin an zâwt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Johana chuan, “Kei chuan tuiin ka baptis a, in zîngah mi pakhat, in hriat loh a ding a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chu ka hnungah a lo kal a; mahse, a pheikhawk hrui phelh tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thil chu Johanan a baptis-na hmun Jordan lui râla Bethani khuaah an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Johanan Isua amah a rawn panin a hmu a, “En teh u, Pathian Berâmno, khawvêl sual la botu saw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saw mi saw a ni, ‘Ka hnunga lo kal tûr, keimah aia ropui zâwk, ka awm hmaa awm tawh,’ ka tiha kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amah chu ka lo hre si lo; nimahsela, Israel-ten amah an hriat theih nân kei hi tuia baptisma chantîrin ka lo kal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hei hi Johanan thu a hriattîr dân chu a ni, “Thlarau chu ṭhuro angin vân aṭanga lo chhuka, a chunga fu rengin ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amah chu ka la hre lo va; nimahsela, tuia baptis tûra mi tîrtu khân ka hnênah, ‘Mi, a chunga Thlarau lo chhuka, fu ta reng i hmuh chu Thlarau Thianghlima baptistu tûr chu a ni ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chu chu ka hmu ta a, he mi hi Pathian Fapa a ni tih ka hriattîr a che u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tûk lehah chuan Johana chu a zirtîrte pahnih nên an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Isua a vei a vei chu an thlîr a, “En teh u, Pathian Berâmno saw!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A zirtîr pahnihten a sawi chu an hriat chuan, Isua chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Isua chu a han lehhawi a, amah an rawn zui chu a hmu a, an hnênah, “Eng nge in zawn?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Rabi, (chu chu zirtîrtu tihna a ni) khaw nge i awm?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Rawn en ta che u,” a ti a. Tichuan, a hnênah an kal a, a awmna chu an va hmu a, chumi ni chuan a hnênah an awm ta a. Tlai dâr li vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Johana thu sawi hriaa Isua zuitu pahnihte chu, pakhat chu Andria, Simon Petera unau a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ani chuan a hmasa berin a unau Simona a va zawng hmu a, “Mesia, (chu chu Krista tihna a ni) kan hmu ta,” a va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Isua hnênah a rawn hruai a. Isuan ani chu a lo en a, “Johana fapa, Simona i ni, Kifa tih i ni ang,” a ti a. Kifa chu Petera tih nên thuhmun a ni a, lungpui tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Isuan Galili rama kal a tum a, Filipa a hmu a, a hnênah, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Filipa chu Andria leh Petera awmna khua, Bethsaida khuaa mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Filipa chuan Nathanaela a hmu a, a hnênah, “A chanchin Dân lehkhabua Mosian a ziak, zâwlneite pawhin an ziak kha, amah chu kan hmu ta, Nazaret Isua, Josefa fapa chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nathanaela chuan, “Nazaret khua aṭangin thil ṭha a chhuak thei em ni?” a ti a.Filipa chuan, “Rawn en ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Isuan Nathanaela lo kal a hmuh chuan a chanchin a lo sawi a, “En teh u, Israel mi tak, mi bum tumna rêng nei lo saw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nathanaela chuan, “Engtin nge mi hriat le?” a ti a. Isuan, “Filipan a koh hma che-a, theipui bula i awm lai khân ka hmu che asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nathanaela chuan, “Rabi, Pathian Fapa i ni. Israel-te lalber i nih hi,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isuan, “Theipui bulah ka hmu che asin,’ i hnêna ka tih avângin i ring a ni maw? Hêng aia thil ropui zâwk hi i la hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, ‘Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, vân inhawnga, Pathian vântirhkohte Mihring Fapa chunga chhuk leh chho in la hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni thum ni chuan Galili rama Kana khuaah inneihna a awm a, chutah chuan Isua nu a awm ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isua leh a zirtîrte pawh inneihnaah chuan an sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uainin a daih ta lo va, Isua nu chuan a hnênah, “Uain an tlachham ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Ka nu, engah nge i lo inrawlh ve duh? Ka hun a la thleng lo a ni e” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isua nu chuan rawngbâwltute hnênah, “In hnêna a sawi apiang chu ti zêl rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda-ten an sakhaw dân, sil fai dân an tih chu an nei a, chumi dân ang chuan lung tuibêl paruk, ṭîn nga emaw, ṭîn sarih dawng vêl emaw ṭheuh chutah chuan an hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Tuibêlahte hian tui chhûng rawh u,” a ti a. A vaiin khat takin an chhûng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, an hnênah, “Thâl ula, fatu hotu hnênah kalpui rawh u,” a ti a. An kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fatu hotu chuan tui uaina chang ta chu a lo tem a, khawia mi nge tih a hre lo va; tui thâl chhuaktute erawh chuan an hria a. Fatu hotu chuan moneitu chu a ko va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a hnênah, “Mi tinin uain ṭha an sem hmasa phawt a, tam deuh an in hnuin a narân deuh an sem ṭhîn a ni a; nang zawngin tûn thlengin uain ṭha i la vawn hi!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isuan he chhinchhiahna thil mak a tih hi Galili rama Kana khuaah a ti a, a ropuizia a lantîr a, zirtîrte chuan amah an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan, Isua chu a nu nên, a unaute leh a zirtîrte nên Kapernaum khuaah an chhuk a, chutah chuan ni tlêm tê chauh an châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda-te Kalhlên Kût hun a thleng lek lek tawh a, Isua chu Jerusalem-ah a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tempulah chuan bâwng te, berâm te, pârva te an lo zuar chu a hmu a, tangka thlengtute an dawhkân bula ṭhu a hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vuakna hruihrual ang a siam a, an berâm nên, bâwng nên, ran dang zawng zawng nên chuan a hnawt chhuak ta vek a; tangka thlengtute dawhkânte chu a nam thlûksak a, an pawisate chu a tihdarhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭhuro zuartute hnênah chuan, “Hêng hi la chhuak rawh u, ka Pa in sumdâwnna hmunah siam suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan, ‘I in tâna ka ṭhahnemngaihna chuan mi ei zo vang,’ tih ziak a nih thu an hre chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Juda-te chuan an rawn chhuahchhâl a, “Hêng thil hi tihtheihna i nei tih entîr nân eng chhinchhiahna thil mak nge min entîr dâwn?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isuan, “He Tempul hi ṭhiat ula, ni thum chhûngin ka tungding leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Juda-te chuan, “Ni thum chhûngin i tungding leh ang maw? He in sak nân hian kum sawmli leh kum ruk a duh asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan Tempul a sawi hi ama taksa thu a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mitthi zîng ata kaihthawha a awm khân chu thu chu a sawi tih zirtîrten an hre chhuak leh a; Lehkha Thu leh Isua thu sawi chu an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Kalhlên Kût Isuan a hman laia chhinchhiahna thil mak a tihte hmutu tam tak chuan amah an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan anni chu a ring ve lo, mi zawng zawng a hriat chian êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi chanchin tu man an hrilh a ngai lo, an thinlung chhûnga awm chu a hre si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi pakhat, a hming Nikodema a awm a, Juda-te hotu, Farisai pâwla mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zân khat chu Isua hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Rabi, Pathian tirh zirtîrtu i ni tih kan hria, Pathian an hnêna a awm loh chuan tu man chhinchhiahna thil mak i tih ang hi an ti thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh ang che, mi tu mah, piangthar lo chuan Pathian ram an hmu thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nikodema chuan, “Putar pui tawh engtin nge a pianthar theih ang? A nu pumah lûtin a piang nawn leh thei awm si lo va?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isuan, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh ang che, tuiah leh thlarauva piang lo chu tu mah Pathian ramah an lût thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tisa chuan tisa a hring a, thlarau chuan thlarau a hring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘I piangthar tûr a ni,’ ka tih hi mak ti suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thli khawiah pawh a duh duhin a tleh ṭhîn, a ri i hria e; nimahsela, khawi aṭanga lo kal nge tih leh, khawiah nge a kal dâwn tih i hre si lo. Tu pawh Thlarauva piang chu chutiang chu an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nikodeman, “Chu chu engtin nge a nih theih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan, “Nang, Israel-te zirtîrtu i ni a, chu chu i hre lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh ang che; kan hriat chu kan sawi a, kan hmuh chu kan hriattîr ṭhîn, tu man kan thu hriattîr in pawm duh chuang si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawvêl thil ka hrilh che u mah in awih si lo va, vân thil lek phei chu hrilh che u ila engtin nge in awih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu mah vânah an lâwn ngai lo, Mihring Fapa, vân aṭanga lo chhuka chauh lo hi chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mosian thlalêra rûl a khai kân ang khân Mihring Fapa hi khai kânin a awm bawk tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />amah ring apiangin chatuan nun an neih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathianin khawvêl a hmangaih êm êm a; tichuan, a Fapa mal neih chhun a pe a, amah ring tawh phawt chu an boral lohva, chatuan nun an neih zâwk nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian chuan khawvêl thiam loh chantîr tûrin a Fapa khawvêlah a tîr si lo, amah azâra khawvêl chhandama an awm theih nân a tîr a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu pawh Pathian Fapa ring chu thiam lohvin an awm lo va, tu pawh ring lo chu thiam lohvin an awm tawh reng a ni; Pathian Fapa mal chu an rin loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thiam loh an chan dân chu hetiang hi a ni: êng chu khawvêlah a lo kal a; nimahsela, miten êng ai chuan thim an duh zâwk, thil sual an tih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil sual ti apiangin êng an haw ṭhîn a, êngah pawh an lo kal lo, an thiltihte a lan loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thil dik ti apiang êngah an lo kal ṭhîn, an thiltihte chu Pathian thu zâwma ti an nih a lan nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Isua leh a zirtîrte chu Judai ramah an kal a. Chutah chuan eng emaw chen a châm a, baptisma a chantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Johana pawhin Salim bula Ainon hmunah a baptis a, chutah chuan tui a tam avângin. Mi an lo kal ṭhîn a, a lo baptis zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Johana chu tân ina khung a la ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Johana zirtîr ṭhenkhatte leh Juda pakhat sil fai thu-ah an lo inhnial ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Johana hnênah an kal a, “Zirtîrtu, Jordan râla i hnêna awm, a chanchin i sawi khân tûnah hian a baptis ve a, mipuiin an pan ruih ruih mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Johanan a chhâng a, “Pathianin a pêk loh chuan tu man eng mah an dawng thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Kei chu Krista ka ni lo va, a hmaa kal tûra tirh ka ni,’ ka tih kha nangmahni ngei ka thuhretute in ni alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mo pasal chu moneitu chu a ni, mo neitu ṭhian, a thu lo ngaichâng rengtu chuan moneitu aw a hriatin a hlim ṭhîn. Chutiang chuan kei pawh ka lâwm a kim ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chu ropui tial tial tûr a ni a, kei erawh chu tê tial tial tûr ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chung lam aṭanga lo chhuka chu mi zawng zawng aia ropui a ni. Lei aṭanga lo chhuaka chu lei mi a ni a, lei thil a sawi ṭhîn; vân aṭanga lo chhuk chu engkim chunga mi a ni. Vân aṭanga lo chhuk chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />thil a hmuh leh a hriatte chu a sawi a; nimahsela, tu man a thuhriattîr chu an pawm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu pawh a thu hriattîr pawm chuan Pathian chu a dik tih an tilang chiang ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian tirha chuan Pathian thu a sawi ṭhîn a, Pathianin Thlarau chu teh kherin a pe si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pain Fapa a hmangaih a, a kutah engkim a dah tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu pawh Fapa ring chuan chatuan nun an nei tawh; Fapa thu awih lo chuan nun an nei lo vang a, an chungah Pathian thinur chu a awm reng zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Farisai-ten Johana aiin Isuan zirtîr tam zâwk a siam a, a baptis tih an hria tih Isuan a hriat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isua tak chuan a baptis lo va, a zirtîrten an baptis zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judai ram a chhuahsan a, Galili ramah a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samari ram a kal tlang a ngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samari rama khaw pakhat, Sukar an tih chu a va thleng a, chu chu Jakoban a fapa Josefa ram a pêk kianga awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakoba tuichhunchhuah pawh chutah chuan a awm a. Isua chu a kal hah êm avângin tuichhunchhuah sîrah chuan a ṭhu chawt a. Chhûn lai tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samari hmeichhia tui chawi tûrin a lo kal a. Isua chuan, “In tûr mi pe rawh,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zirtîrte chu ei tûr leiin khuaah an kal tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Nang Juda mi i ni a, kei Samari hmeichhia ka ni a, engtiziaa in tûr mi dîl nge maw i nih le?” a ti a (Juda-te leh Samari miten eng mah an inhman ṭâwm ngai lo va).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Pathian thilpêk leh i hnêna, ‘In tûr mi pe rawh,’ titu hi hria ni la chuan, a hnênah i dîl zâwk ang a, ani chuan tui nung a pe tûr che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Ka pu, khai chhuahna tûr eng mah i nei si lo va, tuichhunchhuah a thûk vei nên, khawi ata nge tui nung chu i neih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan pu Jakoba aiin i ropui zâwk em ni? Ani chuan he tuichhunchhuah hi min pe a, amah leh a fate leh a ran rualte pawhin heta mi hi an in ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isuan, “Tu pawh he tui in apiang an tuihâl leh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tu pawh an hnêna ka pêk tûr tui in erawh chu an tuihâl leh tawh lo vang. An hnêna ka pêk tûr chu, an kawchhûngah tuihnaah a lo chang ang a, chatuan thlengin a kang lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Ka pu, chu tui chu mi pe rawh, ka tuihâl tawh loh nân leh hêng thleng thlenga tui chawi tûra ka lo kal tawh loh nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isuan, “I pasal va ko la, hetah lo kîr leh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Pasal ka nei hlei nêm,” a ti a. Isuan, “ ‘Pasal ka nei hlei nêm,’ i tih hi i ti dik e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasal panga i nei tawh a, tûna i neih lai hi i pasal a ni lo rêng a ni. I sawi chu a dik e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Ka pu, zâwlnei i ni tih ka hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Min thlahtute chuan he tlângah hian Pathian chibai an bûk ṭhîn a, nangni erawh chuan, ‘Miten Jerusalem-ah ngei Pathian chibai an bûk tûr a ni,’ in ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan, “Hmeichhia, ka thu awih rawh, he tlângah kher lo pawh, Jerusalem-ah kher lo pawh Pa chibai in bûk hun a thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangnin in hriat loh chibai in bûk ṭhîn, keinin kan hriat chu chibai kan bûk ṭhîn; chhandamna chu Juda-te hnên ata lo chhuak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, a hun a thleng dâwn, tûnah pawh a thleng tawh mêk, Pathian chibai bûktu tak takten thlarau leh thutakin Pa chibai an bûk tawh ang. Chutiang mi chu Pain amah chibai bûk tûrin a zawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian chu thlarau a ni a, amah chibai bûktuten thlarau leh thutakin chibai an bûk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Mesia, Krista an tih chu, a lo kal dâwn tih ka hria. A lo kal hun chuan engkim min la hrilh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Kei, a betu che hi amah chu ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan zirtîrte chu an lo thleng tawh a, hmeichhia a bia an rawn hmuh chuan mak an ti hle a. Nimahsela, tu mahin, “Eng nge i duh?” emaw, “Engah nge hmeichhia i biak?” emaw an ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan a tuibêl a kalsan a, khuaah a kîr a, khuaa mite hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Mi pakhat, ka thiltih apiang mi hrilh thei vektu a awm a, lo kal ula, va en teh u, Krista a ni thei âwm emaw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, khua ata chu an chhuak a, Isua hnênah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chumi hlân chuan zirtîrte chuan, “Zirtîrtu, ei rawh,” tiin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani lah chuan, “In hriat loh chaw ei tûr ka nei e,” a ti mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zirtîrte chuan, “Tuten emaw chaw an rawn pe em ni chu le?” tiin an inzâwt ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Mi tîrtu duhzâwng tih leh a hna thawh zawh chu ka chaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Thla li-ah buh seng a hun ang,’ in ti ṭhîn a ni lâwm ni? Dâk chhuak ula, lote en vêl rawh u, buhte chu seng mai theihin a êng tawh tih ka hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Buh sengtu chuan hlawh a hmu nghâl tawh a, chatuan nun atân a seng khâwm mêk a ni, a phuntu leh a sengtu chu an hlim dun theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />‘Mi pakhatin a tuh a, mi dangin a seng a,’ tih thu hi a dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />In thawhrim rah ni lo seng tûrin ka tirh che u hi, mi dangin an thawk a, an thawhrim rah in seng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hmeichhiain, “Ka thiltih apiang mi hrilh thei vek,” a tih avâng khân chumi khuaa Samari mi tam takin Isua an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Samari mite Isua hnên an lo thlen chuan an hnênah châm tûrin an ngên a, chu khuaah chuan ni hnih a châm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A thu an hriat chuan mi dang tam tak pawhin an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “Tûnah zawng i thu sawi avânga ring kan ni ta lo, keimahni ngeiin a thu sawi kan hria a, he mi hi khawvêl chhandamtu a ni ngei tih kan hre ta,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ni hnih hnu chuan chuta ṭangin Galili ramah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amah Isua ngeiin, “Zâwlnei chu ama ram lamah chawimawiin a awm lo,” a lo ti tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Galili ram a va thlen erawh chuan, Galili mite chuan an lo lâwm hle a; Jerusalem-a Kalhlên Kût chhimin an han kal a, kût laia a thiltih engkim an han hmuh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Isua chuan Galili rama Kana, tui uaina a chantîrna khua kha a va thleng leh a. Kapernaum-ah sawrkâr milian tak pakhat fapa damlo a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chu mi chuan Isua, Judai ram aṭangin Galili ramah a lo kal tih a hriatin a hnênah a han kal a, a fapa thi lek lek tidam tûrin Kapernaum-a chhukah a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Chhinchhiahna leh thil mak tih in hmuh loh chuan in ring tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chu mi chuan, “Ka pu, ka fapa chu a thih hmain lo kal hrâm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isuan, “Kal mai rawh; i fapa chu a dam ta,” a ti a. Ani chuan Isua thu sawi chu a ring a, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A zu haw chu kawngah a chhiahhlawhten an lo hmuak a, “I fapa chu a dam ta e,” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A fapa lo dam leh ṭan hun chu a zâwt hlawm a. Anni chuan, “Nimin chhûn dâr khatah khân a khawsikin a thlah ta a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Naupang pa chuan chumi lai tak chu Isuan, “I fapa chu a dam ta,” a hnêna a tih hun kha a ni tih a hre ta a. Tichuan, an chhûngin an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chu chu Isua Judai ram aṭanga Galili rama a kal hnua chhinchhiahna thil mak a tih vawi hnihna a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Juda-te kût pakhat a awm a, Isua pawh Jerusalem-ah a han kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah chuan berâm kawngkhâr bulah dîl pakhat, Hebrai ṭawnga Beth-zatha an tih chu a awm a; hulhliap panga a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutah chuan dam lo tam tak, mitdel te, kebai te, zeng te an awm hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi pakhat, kum sawmthum leh kum riat damlo tawh pawh a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isuan chuta a mu chu a hmu a, rei tak dam lovin a awm tawh tih a hria a, a hnênah, “Dam i duh em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Damlo chuan, “Ka pu, tui a phûl huna dîla mi dah thlatu tu mah ka nei ve si lo va, luh ka tum chhûngin mi dangin mi luh khalh zêl a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isuan, “Tho la, i mutphah la la, kein kal rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu mi chu thâwklehkhatah a lo dam ta mai a; a mutphah chu a la a, kein a kal ta a. Chumi ni chu sabat a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda-te chuan lo dam ta-a hnênah, “Sabat ni a nih hi; kan dânah i mutphah i ken a thiang lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Mi tidamtu ngeiin, ‘I mutphah la la, kein kal rawh,’ mi ti alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anni chuan, “ ‘I mutphah la la, kein kal rawh,’ titu chu tu nge ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Damlo tihdama chuan tu nge a nih a hre si lo; chutah chuan mipui tam tak an awm a, Isua lah chu a kal bo ta mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Isuan Tempulah a hmu a, a hnênah, “Hei, i lo dam tâk hi; sual leh tawh suh, chutilo zawng, i chungah thil ṭha lo lehzual a lo thleng dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu mi chuan amah tidamtu chu Isua a ni tih Juda-te chu a va hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan Juda-te chuan Isua an tinawmnah ṭan ta a, sabat nia mi a tihdam avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isuan anniho chu a chhâng a, “Tûn thlengin ka Pa chuan hna a thawk reng a, kei pawhin amah angin ka thawk zêl a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Juda-te chuan amah tihhlum an tum lehzual sauh va, sabat a bawhchhia chauh pawh ni lovin, Pathian chu, ‘Ka Pa a ni,’ tia Pathian tluka a insiam avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh che u hi, Fapain ama thuin eng mah a ti thei lo; Pa tih a hmuh chauh loh chu; Pa tih ang chu Fapa pawhin a ti ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pain Fapa a hmangaih a, a thiltih engkim a entîr si a. Hêng aia thil ropui zâwk hi a la entîr ang, mak in tih atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pain mitthite a kai tho va, a tinung ang bawkin, Fapa pawhin a duh apiang a tinung ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pain tu chungthu mah a rêlsak lo, Fapa hnênah rorêlna chu a hlân vek a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mi zawng zawngin Pa an zah angin Fapa an zahna tûrin. Tu pawh Fapa zah lo chuan amah tîrtu Pa pawh a zah lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh ka thu hriaa, mi tîrtu ring chuan chatuan nun a nei tawh, thiam loh changin a awm lo vang a, thihna ata nunnaah a lût tawh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, a hun a thleng dâwn, tûnah pawh a thleng tawh mêk; mitthiten Pathian Fapa aw an hriat hun chuan, a hriate chu an nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pa chu nunna hnâr a ni ang bawkin, Fapa pawh chu nunna hnâr nihna a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihring Fapa a nih avângin rorêl theihna a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Chu chu mak ti suh u, thlâna mitthi zawng zawngin a aw an hriat hun a lo thleng dâwn si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tin, thlân aṭangin an lo chhuak ang, thil ṭha titute chu nun nei tûrin an tho leh ang a, thil ṭha lo titute erawh chu thiam loh chang tûrin an tho leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Keimah maiin eng mah ka ti thei lo; Pathianin mi hrilh ang zêlin ro ka rêl a, ka rorêl pawh a dik a ni, keima duhzâwng tih tum lova, mi tîrtu duhzâwng chauh tih ka tum zâwk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mahni chanchin hriattîr ni ila, ka thu hriattîr chu a dik lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi dang, ka thu hriattîrtu a awm, ka thu a hriattîr chu a dik tih pawh ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Johana hnênah mi in tîr a, ani chuan thutak a lo hriattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihring hriatpui ka ngai lo ve; amaherawhchu, chhandama in awm theih nân chûng chu ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Johana chu khâwnvâr alh êng tak ang a ni a, a ênga hlim taka han awm rih pawh in duh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nimahsela, Johana thu hriatpuina aia hriatpuitu pawimawh zâwk ka nei, Pain hna thawh zawh tûra mi pêk te, tûna ka thiltih laite hian Pain kei mi tîr ngei tih a hriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pa mi tîrtu ngei pawh chuan ka thu a hriattîr bawk a ni, a aw in hre ngai lo, a hmêl in hmu ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A thu pawh in thinlungah in vawng reng lo, a mi tirha hi in rin loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lehkha Thu ngun takin in zir ṭhîn, a chhûngah chatuan nun awma in rin avângin. Chu chu ka thu hriattîrtu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin nun nei tûrin ka hnênah in lo kal duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Mihring chawimawina ka zawng lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />nangni erawh chu ka hria a che u, in thinlungah Pathian hmangaihna rêng in nei lo tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka pa thuin ka lo kal a; nimahsela, mi lo lâwm si lo; mahni thuin tu emaw lo kal sela in lo lâwm si ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pathian tak awm chhun fak hlawh tum si lovin, infak tawn in lâwm a, engtin nge in rin theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ka Pa hnêna ka hêk che u ring suh u. A hêktu tûr che u chu Mosia a ni, in innghahna bera kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mosia chu ring ni ula kei pawh mi ring tûr, ka chanchin asin a ziak ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A thu ziak chu in rin miau si loh chuan, ka thu sawi engtin nge in rin theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Galili dîl, Tiberia dîl an tih râlah a kal ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />dam lote chunga chhinchhiahna thil mak a tihte an hmuh avângin mipui nasa takin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isua chu tlângah a chho va, a zirtîrte nên an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda-te Kalhlên Kût chu a hnai tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isua chu a han hawi vêl a, mipui nasa takin amah an rawn pan chu a hmu a, Filipa hnênah, “Hêngho hraina daih tûr chhang khawiah nge kan lei ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu chu Filipa fiah nân a sawi a ni; a tih tûr chu amahin a hre vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Filipan a chhâng a, “Mi tinin tlêm têa an chan ṭheuh tûr pawh duli zahnih man chhangin a daih lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zirtîrte zînga pakhat, Andria, Simon Petera unaupa chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hetah hian mipa naupang pakhat barli chhang tlang nga leh sangha pahnih nei a awm; nimahsela, hêng zozai tân hian chu chu eng tham nge ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan, “Mipuite hi ṭhuttîr rawh u,” a ti a. Chu laiah chuan hlobet hmun a awm duai a. Patlingte chu an ṭhu a, sângnga lai an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isuan chhang chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi a, chuta ṭhuhote chu a sem ta a; an duh tâwk an chang ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kham hnu chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Eng mah rîral awm lo tûrin sem bâng kha dah ṭha rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, an la khâwm a, barli chhang tlang nga eitute hnêna sem bâng chu bâwm sâwm leh pahnih a la khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipuiten chhinchhiahna thil mak a tih chu an hmuh chuan, “He mi hi zâwlnei, khawvêla lo kal tûra chu a nih ngei hi!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isuan amah mana lala siam luih tumin an lo kal dâwn tih a hria a; chuvângin, tlângah amah chauhvin a kal hrang leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlai a lo nih chuan a zirtîrte chu dîlah an chhuk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />lawngah an chuang a, Kapernaum lam panin dîl chu an kân dâwn a. Khua a lo thim ta a, Isua lah chu an hnênah a lo la thleng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thli na tak a tleh avângin tui a lo fâwn nasa ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Km. li vêl lawng an kar hnu chuan, Isuan tui chunga kala lawng a rawn pan chu an hmu a; tichuan, an hlau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Keimah ka ni alâwm, hlau suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lawnga chuan luhtîr an duh a, nimahsela, lawng chuan an pan khawmual chu a thleng ta nghâl mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tûkah chuan, dîl râla mipui la awmte chuan lawng pakhat chauh lo chu lawng dang a awm lo tih an hmu a, Isua chu a zirtîrte hnênah lawngah a chuang ve lo va, a zirtîrte chu anmahni chauhvin an kal tih an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpan lâwmthu a sawi zawha chhang an eina hmun kiangah khân, Tiberi khua aṭanga lo kal lawng dangte chu a lo thleng hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipuiten Isua leh a zirtîrte chutah chuan an awm tawh lo tih an hmuh chuan, lawngahte chuan an chuang a, Isua zawngin Kapernaum-ah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipuiten Isua chu râl lehlama an va hmuh chuan, “Zirtîrtu, eng laiin nge heta i lo thlen?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, chhinchhiahna thil makte in hmuh avânga mi zawng in ni lo va, chhang in ei puar avâng zâwk khân a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chaw dangral mai ûmin phe phe suh u, chatuan nun daih tûr chaw chu ûmin phe zâwk rawh u. Chu chaw chu Mihring Fapain a pe ang che u, Pa Pathianin amah a chhinchhiah tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan annin, “Pathian hna kan thawh theih nân eng nge kan tih tûr?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan, “Pathian hna in thawh tûr chu hei hi a ni, a mi tirh hi ring rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Kan hmuha kan rin theih nân eng chhinchhiahna thil mak nge i tih ang? Eng nge i tih dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Min thlahtuten thlalêrah manna kha an ei a, Lehkha Thu-in, ‘Vân aṭangin anni chu ei tûr a pe,’ a tih ang khân,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Isuan, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, vân aṭanga chhang Mosian a pe lo che u; ka Pa zâwkin chhang tak, vân ata chu, a pe che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian chhang pêk chu vân aṭanga lo chhuka, khawvêl hnêna nun petu hi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Lalpa, chu chhang chu min pe fo rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isuan, “Kei hi nunna chhang chu ka ni; ka hnêna lo kal tawh phawt chu an rilṭâm lo vang, kei mi ring chu an tuihâl ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangnin mi hmuh hnu pawhin mi la ring si lo tih ka hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pain mi pêk apiang ka hnênah an lo kal ang a, ka hnêna lo kal tawh phawt chu ka hnawt chhuak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mahni duh zâwng ti tûr ni lovin, mi tîrtu duhzâwng ti tûr zâwkin vân aṭanga lo chhuk ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi tîrtu duhzâwng chu hei hi a ni: anin mi pêk zawng zawng tu mah hloh lovin ni kin ni-ah kaitho zâwk ila.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka pa duhzâwng chu hei hi a ni: Fapa hmua amah chu ring apiangin chatuan nun nei sela, anni chu ni kin ni-ah ka kaitho vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Vân aṭanga chhang lo chhuk chu ka ni,” a tih avângin Juda-te chu a chungah an phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“He mi hi Josefa fapa Isua a ni lo vem ni? A nu leh pa pawh kan hria alâwm. Engtizia nge ‘Vân aṭanga lo chhuk ka ni,’ a tih tâk ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Phunnawi tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pa, mi tîrtuin a hîp loh chuan tu mah ka hnênah an lo kal thei lo; keiin ni kin ni-ah a lo kala chu ka kaitho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Zâwlneiten, ‘Mi zawng zawng Pathianin a zirtîr ang,’ tiin an ziak a. Mi tin, Pa thu hriaa, a hnên aṭanga zir chu ka hnênah an lo kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Pa hmu tawh an awm tihna a ni lo; Pathian hnên aṭanga lo kal hi Pa hmutu awm chhun chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, a ringtu chuan chatuan nun a nei tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kei hi nunna chhang chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />In thlahtuten thlalêrah mana an ei a; mahse, an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Vân aṭanga chhang lo chhuk erawh hi chu a ei apiang an thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kei hi vân aṭanga chhang nung lo chhuk chu ka ni. He chhang hi tu pawhin an ei chuan kumkhuain an nung reng ang. Chhang ka pêk tûr chu ka taksa hi a ni, khawvêl nun nâna ka pêk chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-te chu nasa takin an inhnial ta a. “Engtin nge he pa hian a tisa ei tûrin min pêk theih ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Isuan, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u; Mihring Fapa tisa in eia, a thisen in in loh chuan nangmahniin nun in nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tu pawh ka tisa eia, ka thisen in chuan chatuan nun a nei tawh, keiin ni kin ni-ah amah chu ka kaitho bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ka tisa hi chaw tak a ni a, ka thisen hi in tûr tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tu pawh ka tisa eia, ka thisen in chu keimahah a awm reng a, kei pawh amahah ka awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Pa, nung chuan mi tîr a, Pa avâng chuan kei pawh ka nung a, chutiang bawkin tu pawh mi ei chu keimah avângin an nung ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hei hi vân aṭanga chhang lo chhuk chu a ni; in thlahtuten chhang an ei ang kha a ni lo, an thih tho kha. He chhang eitu hi chu chatuanin a nung reng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Kapernaum-a sunagog-ah a zirtîr laiin Isuan he thu hi a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />A zirtîrte zînga tam takin chu chu an hria a, “Hei hi thu khirh tak a ni, tu nge hrethiam ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Chu mi thu-ah a zirtîrte an phunnawi tih Isuan a rilruin a hria a, an hnênah, “Hei hian a tilungni lo che u elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi tûn hmaa a awmnaa a kîr chho hmu ta ula, engtin nge ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Nunna petu chu thlarau a ni; tisa chu a ṭangkai lo. In hnêna thu ka sawite hi thlarau leh nunna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Chuti pawhin ṭhenkhatin in la ring duh si lo,” a ti a. Isuan a tîr aṭangin tute nge ring duh lo tûr leh tu nge amah mantîrtu tûr a hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />“Chuvâng tak chuan a ni, in hnênah, ‘Pain kal theihna a pêk loh chuan tu mah ka hnênah an lo kal thei lo,’ ka tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Chuta chinah chuan a zuitute zînga tam takin an bânsan a, an zui ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan Sâwmpahnihte hnênah chuan, “Nangni pawh kal bo ve in duh em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Simon Peteran a chhâng a, “Lalpa, tu hnênah nge kan kal ang? Chatuan nunna thu i nei alâwm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Pathian mi thianghlim chu i ni tih kan ring a, hriat pawh kan hria asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “Nangni Sâwmpahnihte hi keima thlan in ni lâwm ni? In zînga pakhat Diabola a ni lehnghâl vei nên!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Simon Iskariota fapa Juda thu kha a sawi a ni, Sâwmpahnihte zînga pakhat a ni nain amah mantîrtu tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Isuan Galili ram a fang a; Juda-ten amah thah an tum avângin Judai ram chu a fang duh lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda-te Bâwkte Kût chu a hnai tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isua unaute chuan a hnênah, “He hmun hi chhuahsan la, Judai ramah kal rawh, i zirtîrten i thiltih hi an hmuh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu man hmingthan duh siin a rûkin thil an ti ngai lo. Hêng thil hi i tih rau rau chuan khawvêl hmuhah intârlang rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A unaute pawh chuan amah an ring si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Ka hun a la thleng lo, nangni hun erawh chu eng lai pawhin a thleng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawvêlin a haw thei lo che u, kei erawh chu mi hua a ni, an thiltihte a ṭha lo tih ka hriattîr ṭhîn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kûtah chuan han kal rawh u. Kei chu tûnah chuan, Kûtah hian ka han kal rih lo vang; ka hun a la thlen loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutiang chuan a sawi a, Galili ramah chuan a awm ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A unaute Kût hmang tûra an chhoh tâk hnu chuan ani pawh chu langsâr lovin, a rûkin a han chho ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda-ten Kût lai chuan amah an zawng a, “Khawiah nge a awm?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipui chuan a chungchâng thu an sawi sup sup a. Ṭhenkhatin, “Mi ṭha a ni,” an ti a, a ṭhenin, “Ni lo ve, mipui a hruai sual zâwk a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda-te an hlauh avângin a lang erawh chuan tu man a chungchâng an sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kût vânglai tak chuan Isua tempulah a chho va, a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda-te chuan, “He mi hian zir si lovin engtin nge lehkha a thiam?” an ti a, mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “Ka thu zirtîr hi keima zirtîrna a ni lo va, mi tîrtu zirtîrna a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu pawh Pathian duhzâwng tih duh chuan, ka thu zirtîr hi Pathian hnên ata nge keima phuahchawp tih an hre mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahni phuahchawp thu sawitu chuan mahni ropuina a zawng a ni. Mahni tîrtu ropuina zawngtu erawh chu a rinawm a, amahah dik lohna rêng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosian, Dân chu a pe lo che u em ni? Nimahsela, in zînga tu mahin Dân chu in zâwm si lo. Engati nge mi thah in tum?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipui chuan an chhâng a, “Ramhuai i zâwl a nih hi; tuin nge thah tum che?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “Thil pakhat ka ti a, in za-in mak in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosian serh tan thu a pêk che u avângin (Mosia tihchhuah a ni lo va, in thlahtute tihchhuah a nih zâwk kha,) sabat ni pawhin serh in tan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosia Dân bawhchhiat loh nân sabat ni pawha serh tan a nih chuan, engah nge sabat nia mi ka tihdam tâk avânga ka chunga in thinur bîk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pâwn lam lan dân ngawt enin thu peih mai suh u; a nih dân dik tak enin rêl zâwk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jerusalem-a mi ṭhenkhatte chuan, “He mi hi thah an tum chu a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />En teh u, vântlâng hriatin thu a sawi a, tu mahin an kalh si lo. Hotute hian amah hi Krista chu ni ngeiin an hre ta tihna em ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He mi hi khawia mi nge a nih kan hre si a; Krista chu a lo kal hun chuan khawia mi nge a nih tu man an hre dâwn si lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isuan chutia Tempula a zirtîr lai chuan aw ring takin, “Kei mi hria a, khawia mi nge ka nih pawh in hria e. Nimahsela, mahni thu-a lo kal ka ni lo. Mi tîrtu erawh chu mi dik tak a ni, ani chu in hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei chuan ka hria, mi tîr a, a hnên aṭanga lo kal ka nih avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, man an tum a, nimahsela, a hun a la thlen loh avângin tu man an khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mipui zînga mi tam takin amah an ring a, “Krista a lo kal hunah he mi tih aia tam zâwk chhinchhiahna thil mak a rawn ti dâwn chuang em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Farisai-te chuan a chungchâng mipuiin an sawi rûk sup sup chu an hria a, puithiam lalte leh Farisai-te chuan Isua man tûrin vêngtute an tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan, “Rei lo tê in hnênah ka la awm rih ang a, chumi hnu chuan mi tîrtu hnênah ka kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nangnin mi zawng ang a, mi hmu lo vang, ka awmna tûrah chuan in kal thei dâwn si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Juda-te chuan, “Khawiah nge maw kal a tuma, kan hmuh theih dâwn loh chu le? Grik-ho zînga Juda awm darhte hnêna kala, Grik-hote zirtîr a tum em ni ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />‘Mi zawng ang a, mi hmu lo vang, ka awmna tûrah chuan in kal thei dâwn si lo va,’ a tih te hi eng tihna nge ni ang?” an inti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kût ni hnuhnûng ber, ni ropui berah chuan Isua a ding a, aw ring takin a au va, “Tuihâl apiang chu ka hnênah lo kal sela, in rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in a sawi angin, tu pawh kei mi ring chu a kawchhûng aṭangin tui nung luite a lo chhuak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chu chu amah ringtuten Thlarau an la chan tûr thu a sawina a ni; Isua chawimawia a la awm rih loh avângin Thlarau chu pêk a la ni rih lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mipui zînga ṭhenkhatin chûng thute chu an hriat chuan, “He mi hi zâwlnei chu a ni ngei mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi dangin, “Krista chu a ni,” an ti a. Ṭhenkhat erawh chuan, “Krista chu Galili ram aṭangin a lo kal ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />‘Krista chu Davida thlah, Davida awmna khua Bethlehem-a lo piang tûr a ni,’ Lehkha Thu-in a ti a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tichuan, amah avângin mipui zîngah inṭhenna a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhatin amah man an duh a; nimahsela, tu man an khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Vêngtu sipaite chu puithiam lalte leh Farisai-te hnênah chuan an kîr leh a, anni chuan, “Engati nge in rawn hruai loh?” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Vêngtu sipaite chuan an chhâng a, “He mi sawi ang hian tu man thu an la sawi ngai lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Farisai-te chuan an chhâng a, “Nangni pawh a lo bum ve che u elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hotute leh Farisai-te zînga pakhat mahin amah an ring lo tih in hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hêng mipui Dân hre loho hi ânchhe dawng an ni e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />An zînga pakhat, Nikodema, Isua hnêna kal tawh khân, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Kan Dân ang chuan mi a thiamthu sawitîra, eng nge a tih hriat chian hma chuan thiam loh chantîr mai loh tûr a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ani chu an chhâng a, “Nang pawh Galili mi i ni ve elo maw? Lehkha Thu ngun takin chhiar la, Galili ram aṭangin zâwlnei an chhuak ngai lo tih i hre mai ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tichuan, mi tin mahni inah an haw ta ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua erawh chu Oliv tlângah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tûk zîng takah chuan Tempulah a lût leh a. Mipui zawng zawng a hnênah an lo kal a; tin, a ṭhu a, anmahni a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtute leh Farisai-te chuan hmeichhia, a uire lai man an rawn hruai a, a laiah an dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isua hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, he hmeichhia hi a uire lai taka man a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan Dân, Mosia min pêkah chuan hetiang hmeichhia hi lunga den hlum tûr tih a ni a. Nangin engtin nge i ngaih le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu chu amah fiah nân an ti a ni. Isua chu a kûn a, a kut zungṭangin leiah a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutia an zawh sek sek tâkah chuan a han dâk a, an hnênah, “In zînga sual nei lovin lungin dêng hmasa rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kûn a, leiah a ziak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu chu an hriat chuan pakhat khatin a upa bera ṭanin an chhuak fai ta vek a, hmeichhia a awmna ngaia awm nên chauh chuan an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isua chu a han dâk a, a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, khawiah nge an awm tâk? Tu man thiam loh an chantîr na che nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan “Chantîr lo, Lalpa,” a ti a. Isuan a hnênah, “Kei pawhin thiam loh ka chantîr lo va che; kal la, tûn chinah chuan sual leh tawh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah thu a sawi leh a, “Kei khawvêl êng ka ni. Tu pawh mi zui chu thimah an lêng tawp lo vang a, nunna êng an nei zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Farisai-ten, “Mahni thu i hriattîr a ni; i thu hriattîr hi a dik lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isuan, “Mahni thu hriattîr ka nih pawhin ka thu hriattîr chu a dik a ni, ka lo chhuahna leh ka kalna tûr ka hre si a; nangni zawngin ka lo chhuahna leh ka kalna tûr in hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangnin tisa dânin in rêl a, kei zawngin tu ma thu ka rêl ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rêl pawh ni ila, ka thu rêl chu a dik ang a, a rêltu chu keimah mai ni lovin, kei leh Pa, mi tîrtu kan ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In Dânah pawh mi pahnih thu hriattîr chu a dik a ni, tih ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei hi mahni thu hriattîrtu ka ni a, Pa mi tîrtu chuan ka thu mi hriatpui bawk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Khawiah nge i pa chu?” an ti a. Isuan, “Nangnin mi hre lo, ka Pa in hre hek lo. Kei mi hria ni ula, ka Pa pawh in hre tawh tûr,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Tempul thawhlâwm bâwm dahna hmuna a zirtîr laiin a sawi a ni. Tu man amah an man si lo, a hun a la thlen loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Ka kal bo dâwn a, nangnin mi zawng ang, nimahsela, in sualnaah chuan in thi ang; ka kalna tûrah in lo kal thei lo vang,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda-te chuan, “Amah a intihlum dâwn em ni ang? ‘Ka kalna tûrah in lo kal thei lo vang,’ a tih hi?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Nangni hnuai lam aṭanga lo chhuak in ni, kei zawng chung lam aṭanga lo chhuak ka ni; nangni chu he khawvêl ata lo chhuak in ni a; kei zawng he khawvêl ata lo chhuak ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni, ‘in sualnaah chuan in thi ang,’ ka tih che u ni. ‘Ka ni’ ka tih hi in awih loh chuan, chu in sualnaah chuan in thi ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Tu nge i nih?” an ti a. Isuan, “A tîrin in hnênah ka sawi tawh a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In chungchângah hian sawi tûr leh rêl tûr tam tak ka nei; eng pawh ni se, mi tîrtu chu mi dik tak a ni, a hnên aṭanga ka hriat chauh khawvêl hnênah ka sawi ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hnênah Pa thu a sawi tih an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Mihring Fapa hi in khai kân hunah keimah ka ni tih leh, keima thuin eng mah ka ti lo va, Pain mi hrilh ang zêl chauh ka sawi zâwk tih in la hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi tîrtu chu ka hnênah a awm a, keimah chauhva awm tûrin mi kalsan ngai lo; a lâwmzâwng hlîr ka tih ṭhin avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chu thu chu a sawi laiin mi tam takin amah an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Isuan amah ringtu Juda-te hnênah chuan, “Ka thu-a in awm reng chuan ka zirtîrte in ni tak tak ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />thutak in hria ang a, thutak chuan a zalêntîr ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anni chuan an chhâng a, “Abrahama thlahte kan ni a, tu bawihah mah kan awm ngai lo; ‘a zalêntîr ang che u,’ engtiziaa ti nge i nih?’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, thil sual ti apiang chu sual bawih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bawih chu chhûngkuaah a tel kumkhua lo, fapa erawh chu kumkhuain a awm reng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, Fapain a zalêntîr che u chuan in zalên tak tak tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Abrahama thlahte in ni tih ka hria e; nimahsela, min thah in tum si, ka thuin nangmahniah hmun a neih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Keiin Pa hnêna ka hmuh ka sawi a, nangni erawh chuan in pa hnên aṭanga in hriat chu in ti ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Kan pa Abrahama a ni,” tiin an chhâng a. Isuan, “Abrahama fate in nih chuan Abrahama tih ang in ti ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pa hnêna ka hriat thutak hrilhtu che u hi tûnah mi thah in tum si a. Abrahaman hetiang a ti ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />In pa tih ang in ti ve a nih hi,” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Sâwn kan ni lo ve, pa pakhat kan nei, Pathian chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Pathian in pa a nih chuan mi hmangaih ang, Pathian hnên ata lo kal ka ni si a. Keima thu-a lo kal ka ni si lo, amahin mi tîr zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Engati nge ka thu sawi in hriatthiam loh? Ka thu in dawn fuh theih loh vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nangni zawng in pa Diabola laka chhuak in ni a, in pa duhzâwng tih in duh a ni. Ani chu a tîr ata tualthattu a ni a, thutakah a ding ngai lo, amahah thutak a awm loh avângin. Dâwt a sawiin amaha chhuak chu a sawi a ni; dawthei a ni a, dâwt pa a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Keiin thutak ka sawi avângin mi ring lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In zîngah ka sualna tu nge sawi thei awm? Thutak ka sawi a, engati nge mi rin si loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian aṭanga chhuak chuan Pathian thu a ngaithla ṭhîn; nangni erawh zawngin ka thu in ngaithla lo, Pathian laka chhuak in nih loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Juda-te chuan an chhâng a, “Samari mi i ni a, ramhuai i zâwl a ni kan tih kha kan tidik a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Isuan, “Ramhuai zâwl ka ni lo va, ka Pa ka chawimawi a ni zâwk e, nangni lahin mi tihmingchhe si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Keima ropuina tûr ka zawng lo, a zawngtu leh a ngaihtuahtu chu a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh ka thu zâwm chuan thih ni hmêl a hmu lo kumkhua ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Juda-ten a hnênah, “Tûnah chuan ramhuai i zâwl a ni tih kan hre chiang ta; Abrahama a thi tawh a, zâwlneite pawh an thi tawh a, nang lahin, ‘Tu pawh ka thu zâwm chuan thihna a tem lo kumkhua ang,’ i ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Min thlahtu Abrahama aiin i ropui zâwk em ni? Ani pawh a thi tawh, zâwlneite pawh an thi tawh, tu-ah nge i insiam le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Isuan, “Mahni inchawimawi ila ka mawina chu eng mah a ni lo. Ka Pa, ‘Kan Pathian a ni,’ in tiha chu mi chawimawitu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ani chu in hre si lo, kei erawh chuan ka hria; ‘Ani chu ka hre lo,’ ka tih chuan, nangmahni ang bawka mi dawthei ka lo ni ang; nimahsela, amah ka hria a, a thu pawh ka zâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />In thlahtu Abrahama kha ka ni hmu tûr a nih avângin a hlim êm êm a, a hmu ta ngei a, a lâwm rêng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Juda-te chuan a hnênah, “Kum sawmnga pawh la tling lo pui che, Abrahama i hmu maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Isuan, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, Abrahama pian hma pawhin Ka Awm tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Amah den nân lung an chhar ta a; mahse, Isua a biru a, Tempul ata a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua chuan a kal pahin mitdel saa piang a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan, “Rabi, mitdel saa a piang hi tuin nge thil sual ti, he mi hian nge a nu leh pain?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “He mi hian a tisual lo, a nu leh pain an tisual hek lo, amahah Pathian hnathawh a lan theihna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhûn a nih lai hian mi tîrtu hna kan thawk tûr a ni. Tu man hna an thawh theih loh hun zân a lo thleng dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawvêla ka awm chhûng hian khawvêl êng ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawhin leiah chil a chhâk a, chu chuan hlum a siam a, a mitah hlum chu a bel a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Siloam dîlah va sil rawh,” a ti a. Siloam chu, ‘tîrh,’ tihna a ni. Tichuan, a va kal a, a sil a, mit vârin a lo kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ṭhenawmte leh tûn hmaa a kutdawh hmu ṭhînte chuan, “He mi hi kutdawha ṭhu reng ṭhîn kha a ni lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin, “Kha kha a ni,” an ti a. Mi dangin, “Ni lo, a anpui a ni zâwk,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Kha mi kha ka ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Engtin nge i mit a lo vâr tâk?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Mi pakhat, Isua an tih khân hlum a siam a, ka mitah a tât a, ‘Siloam dîlah va sil rawh,’ mi ti a. Tichuan, ka va sil a, ka lo hmu thei ta mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Khawiah nge a awm?” an ti a. “Ka hre lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, mitdel ni ṭhîna chu Farisai-te hnênah an hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isuan hlum a siam a, a mit a tihvâr ni chu sabat a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Farisai-te chuan a lo hmuh theih tâk dân chu an lo zâwt leh a. Ani chuan, “Ka mitah hlum a dah a, ka sil a, ka hmu ta mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Farisai-te zînga mi ṭhenkhatin, “He mi hi Pathian hnên aṭanga lo chhuak a ni lo, sabat a serh loh avângin,” an ti a. Ṭhenkhat chuan, “Mi sualin engtin nge hetiang chhinchhiahna thil mak a tih theih ang?” an ti a. An zîngah inṭhenna a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mitdel hnênah chuan, “Ani chu mi engah nge i ngaih, i mit a tihvârsak si che a?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Zâwlnei a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Juda-te chuan khaw hmu thei ta-a nu leh pa chu an koh hma chuan, ‘mitdel a ni ṭhîn a, khua a lo hmu leh thei ta a ni’ tih an awih lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, “He mi hi in fapa, mitdel saa piang in tih kha a ni maw? Engtin nge tûnah hian a lo hmuh theih tâk?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nu leh a pa chuan an chhâng a, “Hei hi kan fapa a ni tih leh, mitdel saa piang a ni tih kan hria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />engtin nge tûnah hian a lo hmuh theih tâk erawh chu kan hre lo, a mit tihvârsaktu pawh kan hre hek lo; amah zâwt rawh u. Puitling a ni ve tawh alâwm; aman ama thu chu sawi rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nu leh pa chuan Juda-te an hlauh avângin chutiang chuan an ti a ni; Juda-te chuan, “Ani chu Krista a ni,” tia pawm apiang chu sunagog-a hnawntîr an lo remti tlâng diam si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni, a nu leh pa chuan, “Puitling a ni ve tawh alâwm, amah zâwt rawh u,” an tih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mitdel ni ṭhîna chu an ko nawn leh a, a hnênah, “Pathian chawimawi rawh. He mi hi mi sual a ni tih kan hria,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Mi sual a nih leh nih loh ka hre lo, thil pakhat ka hria, mitdel ka ni ṭhîn a, tûnah ka hmu thei ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Engtin nge a tih che? I mit engtin nge a tihvâr?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka hrilh tawh reng che u a, in hre duh si lo; engtizia nge in hriat duh leh tâk ni? Nangni pawh a zirtîrte nih ve in duh elo?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anni chuan an hau ta a, “Nang hi chu pa zirtîr chu i ni a, keini zawng Mosia zirtîrte kan ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathianin Mosia a bia tih kan hria, he mi ve hi chu khawia mi nge a nih kan hre hrep lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chu mi chuan a chhâng a, “Chu tak chu a ni, a makna chu, khawia mi nge a nih in hre lo va, ka mit a tihvâr miau si hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathianin mi sual thu a ngaithla lo tih kan hria; Pathian ngaihsaka, a duhzâwng titute thu erawh chu a ngaithla ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khawvêl awm tirh ata mitdel saa piang mit tivâr ta tu man an hre ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />He mi hi Pathian aṭanga lo chhuak a nih loh chuan eng mah a ti thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Anni chuan an chhâng lêt a, “Sual muhlûma piang i nih hi, mi i zirtîr tehlul ang maw?” an ti a. Tichuan, an hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An hnawt chhuak tih Isuan a lo hria a, a va zawng chhuak a, “Mihring Fapa i ring em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chu mi chuan a chhang a, “Ka pu, ani chu tu nge ni le, amah ka rin theih nân?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Isuan, “Ani chu i hmu tawh a, be mêktu che hi a ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Lalpa, ka ring e,” tiin chibai a bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isuan, “Rorêl tûrin he khawvêlah lo kal ka ni, hmu thei loten an hmuh theiha, hmu theite chu mitdel an lo nihna tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A hnêna Farisai awmte chuan chu chu an hria a, a hnênah, “Keini pawh mitdel kan ni ve elo?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Mitdel in nih chuan sual in nei lo vang; tûnah, ‘Kan hmu thei e,’ in ti miau si a, in sual chu a awm reng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh berâm huang kawngkaa lût lova, hmun danga lâwn lût chu rûkhmang leh suamhmang an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kawngkaa lût erawh chu berâm vêngtu chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtuin ani chu kawng a lo hawnsak ṭhîn a, berâmte pawhin a aw an hria; ama berâmte chu an hming ṭheuhvin a ko va, a hruai chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama ta zawng zawng a chhuahtîr zawh chuan an hma a hruai a, berâmte chuan amah an zui ṭhîn, a aw an hriat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi dang zawng an zui lo vang a, an tlân bosan zâwk ang, mi dang aw chu an hriat loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu tehkhin thu chu Isuan an hnênah a sawi a; nimahsela, a thu sawi awmzia chu an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan an hnênah thu a sawi leh a, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, kei hi berâmte tân kawngka ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hmaa lo kal zawng zawng kha rûkhmang leh suamhmang an ni; mahse, berâmten an aw an ngaithla lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei kawngka chu ka ni; tu pawh keimaha lût chu a him ang a, a lûtin a chhuak ang a, tlatna ṭha a hmu bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rûkru chu ru tûr leh tihlum tûr leh tichhe tûr lo chuan a lo kal lo; kei zawng nun an neih nân, tam taka an neih nân lo kal ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei berâm vêngtu ṭha ka ni; berâm vêngtu ṭhain berâmte tân a nun a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inhlawhfa, berâmpu tak ni lova, berâm neitu ni hek lo chuan chinghne lo kal a hmuhin berâmte a tlânsan ṭhîn a, chinghnia chuan berâmte chu a seh a, a tidarh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Inhlawhfa mai a ni a, berâmte a ngaihsak loh avângin a tlânsan ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei zawng berâm vêngtu ṭha ka ni; ka ta chu ka hria a, ka ta pawhin mi hria,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pain mi hriat leh keiin Pa ka hriat ang hian; berâmte tân chuan ka nun ka pe bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />He berâm huanga mi lo hi berâm dang ka nei; anni pawh ka la rawn hruai ngei dâwn. Ka aw pawh an ngaithla ang a, vêngtu pakhat neiin berâm rual khat an ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lâk leh tûra ka nun ka pêk dâwn avâng hian Pain mi hmangaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu man mi lâksak lo vang, keima duh thuin ka pe dâwn a ni zâwk. Pe thei ka ni a, la leh thei pawh ka ni; chu thupêk chu ka Pa hnên aṭangin ka hmu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng thu avâng chuan Juda-te zîngah inṭhenna a lo awm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An zîngah mi tam takin, “Ramhuai a zâwl a, a â a ni; engah nge a thu in ngaihthlâk?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin, “Hêng thu hi ramhuai zâwl thu a ni lo ve, ramhuaiin mitdel mit a tivâr thei em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah Tempul Hlan Thar lehna Kût hman lai a ni a, thlasik lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isua chu tempula Solomona hulhliapah a vei a vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda-te a vêlah an lo pung khâwm a, a hnênah, “Eng chen nge tuilairapin min awmtîr dâwn? Krista i nih chuan chiang takin min hrilh rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Ka hrilh tawh che u kha, in awih si lo; ka Pa hminga hna ka thawhte hian ka chanchin a hriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, in awih si lo, ka berâm zînga mi in nih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka berâmten ka aw an hria a, kei pawhin anni chu ka hria a, mi zui ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />an hnênah chatuan nun ka pe a, kumkhuain an thi lo vang; tu man ka kut ata mi chhuhsak hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anni mi petu ka Pa chu engkim aia ropui zâwk a ni; ka Pa kuta awm chu tu man an chhuhsak thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kei leh Pa chu pumkhat kan ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Juda-te chuan amah denna tûrin lung an chhar leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Paa chhuak hna ṭha tam tak in mit hmuhah ka thawk a, ka hnathawhte zînga a eng vâng ber hian nge lunga mi den dâwn hi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Juda-te chuan an chhâng a, “Hna ṭha thawh avângin lungin kan dêng dâwn lo che. Pathian pawi i sawi a, nang mihring mai si, Pathiana i insiam avâng zâwkin a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “In Dân Lehkhabuah, ‘Pathiante in ni ka ti,” tih ziak a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian thu thlennate mah pathiante tih an nih chuan, Lehkha Thu chu hnâwl theih a ni si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathianin a serh hran, khawvêla a tirha hian, ‘Pathian Fapa ka ni,’ ka intih avângin, ‘Pathian pawi i sawi,’ min ti maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pa hna thawk ka nih loh chuan mi ring suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />thawk ka nih erawh chuan kei mi ring lo mah ula, ka hnathawhte tal hi ring rawh u; Pa chu keimahah a awm a, kei Paah ka awm tih in hriata in chian theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ani chu man an tum leh a; mahse, an kut ata a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jordan râlah, Johanan tûn hmaa baptisma a chantîrna hmunah khân a va kal leh a, chutah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mi tam tak a hnênah an lo kal a, “Johanan chhinchhiahna thil mak eng mah a ti lo; amaherawhchu, Johanan he mi chungchâng a sawi apiang kha a lo dik a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutah chuan mi tam takin amah an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bethani khuaa mi pakhat Lazara a damlo va, chu khua chu Mari leh a laizâwn Marthi awmna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Damlo chu Mari nuṭa Lazara a ni. Mari chu Lalpa hriak rimtui chulha, a sama a ke hrûksaktu kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, a farnute chuan, “Lalpa, i hmangaih kha a dam lo ve,” tiin mi an hrilhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isuan a lo hriat chuan, “He natna hi thihna tûr a ni lo ve, Pathian ropuina tûr a ni zâwk. Hemi avâng hian Pathian Fapa hi chawimawiin a awm dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isuan Marthi leh a laizâwnnu leh Lazara chu a hmangaih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mahse, a damlo tih a hriatin a awmna ngaiah ni hnih a la awm ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Judai ramah i kal leh ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan, “Zirtîrtu, tûn lawkah Juda-ten lunga den che an tum a, chutah chuan i kal leh ang maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Chhûnah dârkâr sâwm leh pahnih a awm lo vem ni? Mi chhûna a lên chuan a petek ngai lo, he khawvêl êng hi a hmuh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zâna a lên erawh chuan a petek ṭhîn, amahah êng a awm loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawhin an hnênah, “Kan ṭhian Lazara kha a muhîl a; mahse, amah kaitho tûrin ka kal dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, a muthilh chuan a ṭha leh mai ang chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isuan a thih thu a sawina chu mut pangngaia a muthilh thu a sawina emaw an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan fiah takin a sawi a, “Lazara a thi a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />nangmahni avângin chuta ka awm lo chu ka lâwm a ni, in rin theih nân; eng pawh ni se, a hnênah i kal ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thoma, Phîra an tih chuan a zirtîrpuite hnênah, “Thih leh thih, a hnênah i kal ve ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isua a va thlen chuan ni li thlânah a awm tawh tih a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethani chu Jerusalem kiang lawka awm a ni, km. thum vêla hla a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda-te zînga tam tak, an nuṭa thih chungchânga Marthi leh Mari khawhar lênpui tûrin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Marthi chuan Isua a lo thleng dâwn tih a hriat chuan a va hmuak a; Mari erawh chuan in a nghâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Marthi chuan Isua hnênah, “Lalpa, hetah awm ni la chu, ka nuṭa a thi lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah pawh Pathian hnêna i dîl apiang Pathianin a pe ang che tih ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan, “I nuṭa a tholeh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Marthiin, “Ni kin nia thawhlehnaah chuan a tholeh ang tih chu ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isuan, “Kei hi thawhlehna leh nunna chu ka ni, tu pawh mi ring chu thi mah sela, a nung reng ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tu pawh mi nung la dam kei mi ring chu, kumkhuain a thi lo vang; chu chu i ring em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ring e, Lalpa, Krista, Pathian Fapa khawvêla lo kal tûra chu i ni tih ka ring e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawhin a kal a, a laizâwn Mari chu a rûk têin a va ko va, “Zirtîrtu hetah a awm a, a ko va che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani chuan chu chu a hriat veleh a tho thuai a, a hnênah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isua chu khuaah a lût rih lo va, Marthiin a va hmuhna hmunah khân a la awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Juda-te, in chhûnga khawhar ṭhutpuia awmte chuan, Mari a tho thuai a, a chhuak ta chu an hmuhin, thlânah ṭap tûrin a kal dâwn emaw an ti a, an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Marin Isua awmna a va thlena, amah a hmuh chuan a ke bulah a bawkkhup a, “Lalpa, heta awm ni la chu, ka nuṭa a thi lo tûr,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Isuan Mari ṭap leh amah rawn zuitu Juda-te ṭap chu a hmu a, a rilru a khawih a, a hnuk a ulh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Khawiah nge in phûm?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Lalpa, lo kal la, en teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isua a ṭap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Juda-te chuan, “En teh u, Lazara hi a va lo hmangaih êm!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhat chuan, “Mitdel mit tivârtu hian he mi pawh hi a thih lohtîr thei dâwn lâwm ni?” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Isua chu hnuk ulh ṭeuh chungin thlân chu a thleng ta a. Pûk a ni a, lunga khâr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isuan, “Lung hi dah sawn rawh u,” a ti a. A thia farnu Marthi chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, tûnah zawng a rimchhe tawh ang, a thihna ni li a ni tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “I rin chuan Pathian ropuizia i hmu ang ka ti lo che em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tichuan, lung chu an dah sawn ta a. Isua chu a vânvadâk a, “Ka Pa, ka thu i ngaihthlâk avângin lâwmthu ka hrilh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka thu i ngaithla ṭhîn tih pawh ka hria; nimahsela, heta pung khâwmte avâng hian chu chu ka sawi a ni, nangin kei mi tîr tih an rin theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawh chuan aw ring takin a au va, “Lazar, lo chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mitthi chu a kut a ke thlân puana inzem chungin a lo chhuak a, a hmai pawh inhrûkna puana tuam a ni a. Isuan an hnênah, “Phelh ula, kaltîr rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mari lênpuitu, Isua thiltih hmutu Juda-te zînga tam tak chuan amah chu an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat erawh chu Farisai-te hnênah an kal a, Isua thiltihte chu an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chutichuan, Puithiam lalte leh Farisai-te chuan Sanhedrin an ko va, “He mi hian chhinchhiahna thil mak tam tak a ti ta si a, engtin nge kan tih tâk ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hetianga kan thlahzal chuan mi zawng zawngin amah an ring dâwn a, Rom mite an lo kal ang a, kan hmun thianghlim leh kan hnam hi min rawn tihchhiatsak mai ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />An zînga pakhat, Kaiafa, chumi kuma Puithiam lalber chuan an hnênah, “In va han hre lo êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mipui aia mi pakhat a thiha, hnam pum pui a chimih loh chu in tân a ṭha zâwk tih in hrethiam lo va ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chu chu ama rilru puak chhuaka sawi a ni lo; chumi kum chuan Puithiam lalber a ni a, an hnam aia Isua thih tûr a sawi lâwk a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />An hnam ai mai pawh ni lovin, Pathian fa khawvêla darhte pâwl khata a hruai khâwm lehna tûr pawh a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chumi aṭang chuan amah tihhlum an tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chuvângin, Isua chu a langin Juda-te zîngah a lêng ta lo va, chuta ṭang chuan thlalêr dep rama khaw pakhat Efraim an tihah chuan a kal a, chutah chuan a zirtîrte nên an awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Juda-te Kalhlên Kût a lo hnai ta a, thingtlâng aṭangin mi tam tak chu Kalhlên Kût hmaa inthian tûrin Jerusalem-ah an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Isua chu an zawng a, Tempula an din ho laite chuan, “Eng nge in rin dân? Kûtah hian a lo kal lo vang maw?” an inti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Farisai-ten amah an man theih nân, tu pawhin a awmna an hriat chuan, thuneitute an hriattîr tûr a ni tih thu an pe si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kalhlên Kût hma ni rukah, Isua chuan a mitthi kaihthawh Lazara awmna Bethani a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutah chuan a tân zanriah an buatsaih a, Marthiin chaw kîl ho chu a vil a, Lazara pawh a kîlpuitute zîngah a tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Marin nard hriak rimtui hlîr hlak, man tam tak, no khat a rawn keng a, Isua keah a chulh a, a ke chu a samin a hru a. Hriak rim chu inah chuan a khat ta rum rum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zirtîrte zînga pakhat, Juda Iskariota, amah mantîrtu tûr chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Engati nge he hriak rimtui hi duli zathuma hralhin mi retheite an pêk zâwk loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi retheite a ngaihsak avânga chu chu sawi a ni lo, rûkru a ni a, tangka ip a kawl a, a chhûnga awm chu a lâk ṭhin avâng zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isuan, “Eng mah tih suh u, mi phûm ni atân ring rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In zîngah mi retheite chu an awm reng alâwm, kei erawh chu in zîngah ka awm reng dâwn lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda mi tam takin chutah chuan a awm tih an lo hre ta a, Isua chauh hmuh duha lo kal an ni lo va, mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh Lazara hmuh an duh bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiam lalte chuan Lazara pawh chu tihhlum an tum ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amah avânga Juda-te tam takin an pakaisana, Isua an rin tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tûkah chuan kûta lo kal mipui nasa takin Isua Jerusalemah a lo lût dâwn tih an hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tûmkaute an keng a, a hmuak tûrin an chhuak a, “Hosana, Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se, Israel lal chu fakin awm rawh se,” tiin an au dual dual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isuan sabengtung a hmu a, a chungah a chuang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hlau suh, Zion fanu, En teh, i lal chu a lo kal e, Sabengtung no chunga chuangin,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng chu a zirtîrten a tîrin an hrethiam lo va; nimahsela, Isua chawimawia a awm hnu chuan a chungchâng chutianga ziak a ni a, a chungah chûng thil chu an lo ti a ni tih an hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lazara thlân ata a koh chhuaha, mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh laia a hnêna mipui awmte khân chu thu chu an hriattîr zêl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu chhinchhiahna thil mak chu a ti tih an hriat avângin a ni, mipuite chuan amah an va hmuah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Farisai-te chuan, “Eng mah in tih thei lo a nih hi; en rawh u, khawvêlin amah an zui tâk hi,” an in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kût laia Pathian chibai bûk tûra han kalte zîngah Grik tute emaw an tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûngte chu Galili rama Bethsaida khaw mi Filipa hnênah an kal a, “Ka pu, Isua hmuh kan duh e,” tiin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Filipa chuan Andria a rawn hrilh a, Andria leh Filipa chuan Isua an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan a lo chhâng a, “Mihring Fapa chawimawia a awm hun a lo thleng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u; buh fang leia a tlâka a thih loh chuan, a malin a awm reng mai a, a thih erawh chuan rah tam tak a chhuah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mahni nun thlahleltu chuan a hloh ṭhîn, he khawvêla mahni nun hawtu chuan a vawng reng ang a, chatuan nun a nei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu pawhin ka rawngbâwl an tum chuan mi zui rawh se, ka awmnaah ka rawngbâwltu pawh an awm ve ang. Tu pawhin ka râwng an bâwl chuan Pain a chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tûnah ka rilru a mangang hle, eng nge ka sawi tâk ang le? ‘Ka Pa, hemi hun lakah hian mi chhandam rawh,’ ka ti dâwn em ni? Dâwn lo ve, he thil tuar tûr hian he hun hi ka lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka Pa, i hming chawimawi rawh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, vân aṭangin aw a lo chhuak a, “Ka chawimawi tawh, ka chawimawi leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuta mipui ding vete chuan aw chu an hriatin, “Khawpui a ri a ni,” an ti a; a ṭhenin, “Vântîrhkohvin a bia a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Chu aw chu ka tâna lo chhuak a ni lo, in tân a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tûn hi khawvêl chungchâng ngaihtuah lai a ni, tûnah he khawvêl rorêltu hi paih chhuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kei lei ata khai kâna ka awm chuan, mi zawng zawng ka lamah ka hîp ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chu chu eng tiangin nge a thih dâwn entîr nân a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipui chuan an chhâng a, “Krista chu kumkhuain a awm reng dâwn tih Dân lehkhabu aṭangin kan hria a ni, engtiziaa nangin, ‘Mihring Fapa chu khai kânin a awm ang,’ ti nge i nih? Chu Mihring Fapa chu tu nge ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Êng hi rei lo tê in zîngah a la awm rih ang; êng in la neih chhûng hian lêng rawh u, thimin a nang dâwn lo che u nia; thima lêng chuan a kalna chin a hre si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />êng in la neih chhûng hian êng hi ring rawh u, êng fate in nih theih nân,” a ti a. Chûng thu chu Isuan a sawi a, a kal ta daih a, an hmuh loh tûrin a biru ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutiang chhinchhiahna thil mak tam tak chu an mit hmuhah ti mah se amah an ring si lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaian: “Lalpa, kan thu sawi tuin nge ring? Lalpa kut pawh tu hnênah nge a lan?” a tih kha a lo thlen nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian an ring thei lo va ni, Isaian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“An mit a tidel a, an thinlung a tingawng a, An mitin a hmuh loh nân leh, an thinlungin a hriatthiam loh nân. Chuti ni lo se, an hawi kîr leh ang a, Anni chu ka tidam tûr,” a tih leh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isaian chûng thu a sawi chu a ropuizia a hmuh avângin a chanchin a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin hotute zînga mi tam takin Isua chu an ring ta a; amaherawhchu, Farisai-te avângin an insawi lang ngam lo, sunagog-a an hnawn loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pathian chawimawina aiin mihring chawimawina an duh zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Isua a au chhuak a, “Tu pawh mi ring chu kei mi ring a ni lo va, mi tîrtu ring a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tu pawh mi hmu chu mi tîrtu hmu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />êntu atân khawvêla lo kal ka ni, mi ring apiang chu tu mah thima an awm loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tu pawhin ka thu hriain zâwm lo sela, ani chu keiin thiam loh chantîr tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, khawvêl chhandam tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tu pawh mi hnara, ka thu pawm lo chuan a chungthu rêlsaktu tûr pakhat a nei. Ka thu sawi ngei kha ni kin ni-ah chuan a chungthu rêlsaktu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Keima phuahchawpin ka sawi lo va, mi tîrtu, Pa ngei chuan, ka sawi tûr leh ka ṭawng tûr thu mi pe zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A thupêk chu chatuan nunna a ni tih kan hria. Chuvângin, Pain sawi tûra mi hrilh ang chu ka sawi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kalhlên Kût dâwn a ni a, Isuan he khawvêl chhuahsana, Pa hnêna a kal hun a thleng ta tih a hria a; ama mi khawvêla awmte chu a hmangaih a, a tâwp thlengin a hmangaih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, zanriah an kîl a, Diabola chuan Simon Iskariota fapa Juda chu Isua mantîr a lo tum rilrûktîr tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isuan, Pain engkim a kutah a dah tih leh Pathian aṭanga lo chhuak a ni a, Pathian hnênah a kal dâwn tih a hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a zanriah kîl lai chu a tho va, a kawrfual a hlîp a, inhrûkna puan a la a, a veng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, maihûnah tui a bun a, zirtîrte ke a sîl ta a, inhrûkna puan chuan a hru zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simon Petera hnên a lo thleng a, Petera chuan, “Lalpa, nang meuhvin ka ke i sil ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Ka thiltih hi tûnah i hre lo; nimahsela, nakinah i la hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Peteran a hnênah, “Ka ke zawng i sil tawp lo vang,” a ti a. Isuan a chhâng a, “I ke ka sil loh chuan eng mah mi ṭâwmpui thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simon Petera chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, chuti chu, ka ke chauh ni lovin, ka kut leh ka lu pawh hi le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Inbual tawh chu a ke chauh lo chu sil a ngai tawh lo, a pumin a fai alâwm. Nangni in fai e, in za erawh chuan a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah mantîrtu tûr chu a hre si a; chuvângin, ‘In za chuan in fai lo,’ a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ke a sil zawh chuan, a kawr dah kha a ha a, a ṭhu leh ta a, an hnênah, “In chunga ka thiltih hi a awmzia in hria em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangnin, zirtîrtu leh Lalpa mi ti ṭhîn, in ti dik e, ka ni rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei Lalpa leh zirtîrtu mahin in ke ka sil chuan, nangni pawh in ke in insilsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In chunga ka tih anga in tih vena tûrin entawn tûr ka siamsak che u a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, bawih a pu aiin a ropui lo, tîrhkoh pawh a tîrtu aiin a ropui hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng chu in hre ta a, in zawm chuan in lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In zaa thu ka sawi lo; ka thlante chu ka hria; amaherawhchu: “Ka chhang eitu chu ka hmêlma a lo chang ta,” tih lehkha thu kha a lo thleng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tûnah a lo thlen hma hian ka hrilh che u hi, a lo thlen hunah ani chu ka ni ngei tih in rin theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, ka mi tirh lo lâwmtu chuan keimah mi lâwm a ni a, kei mi lâwmtu chuan mi tîrtu a lâwm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan chûng thu chu a sawi zawhin a rilru a mangang a, “Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, in zînga mi pakhatin mi mantîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu ber nge a tih hre lovin zirtîrte chu an inen ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A zirtîrte zînga pakhat, Isuan a hmangaih chu, Isua hnaih berah chaw kîlin a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tu ber nge a tih hriat nân zaizîrin Simon Peteran ani chu a zawhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, chu mi chu Isua âwm nghêngin a va thle phei a, “Lalpa, tu hian maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Chhang them ka chiaha ka pêka chu a ni ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, chhang them chu a chiah a, Simon Iskariota fapa Juda chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judan chhang them a lâk hnu chuan a chhûngah Setana a lût ta a. Isuan a hnênah, “I tih tûr chu ti thuai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuta ṭhuho zînga tu mahin chu chu eng vânga a hnêna sawi nge a nih an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin, Juda chuan tangka ip a kawl avângin Isuan, “Kût atân thil kan mamawhte lei rawh,” a ti emaw, “Mi retheite hnênah englo pêk tûr,” a ti emaw an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Juda chuan chhang them chu a la a, a chhuak ta nghâl a; zân a ni tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A chhuah tâk hnu chuan Isuan, “Tûnah chuan Mihring Fapa chawimawiin a awm ta, amahah Pathian pawh chawimawiin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Amahah Pathian chawimawia a awm chuan, Pathianin ani pawh a hmaah a la chawimawi ang a, a chawimawi nghâl bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naute u, rei lo tê in hnênah ka la awm rih a, nangnin mi zawng ang a, ‘Ka kalna tûrah in lo kal thei lo vang,’ Juda-te hnêna ka tih ang khân tûnah nangni hnênah pawh ka tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Thupêk thar ka pe a che u; inhmangaih tawn rawh u; keiin ka hmangaih che u angin nangni pawh inhmangaih tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />In inhmangaih tawn chuan mi zawng zawngin ka zirtîrte in ni tih chumiah chuan an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simon Peteran a hnênah, “Lalpa, khawiah nge i kal dâwn?” a ti a. Isuan a chhâng a, “Tûnah chuan ka kalna tûrah mi zui thei lo vang a, nakinah mi la zui ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Peteran, “Lalpa, eng vângin nge tûnah pawh ka zui theih lo vang che? I tân chuan thih ka huam asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Ka tân thih i huam maw? Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che, nangin vawi thum mi phat hma loh chuan âr a khuang lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“In thinlung mangang suh se, Pathian ring ula, kei pawh hi mi ring rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pa inah awmna tam tak a awm a; chuti ni suh sela, in tân hmun siama ka kal tûr thu ka hrilh dâwn che u em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In tân hmun siama ka kal hnuah ka lo kîr leh ang a, ka hnênah ka hruai ang che u, ka awmnaah in awm ve theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kalna tûr kawng pawh in hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thoman a hnênah, “Lalpa, i kalna tûr kan hre lo asin, engtin nge a kawng kan hriat theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Keimah hi kawng leh thutak leh nunna chu ka ni; keimaha kal lo chu tu mah Pa hnên an thleng ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei mi hria ni ula, ka Pa pawh in hre tûr; tûnah zawng amah in hria e, in hmu tawh bawk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filipan a hnênah, “Lalpa, Pa chu min hmuhtîr la, kan tân a tâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isuan, “Filip, hei leh chen hi in hnênah ka awm a, mi la hre lo cheu maw? Kei mi hmu chu Pa hmu a ni. Engtiziaa Pa chu min hmuhtîr rawh ti nge i nih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Paah ka awm a, Pa keimahah a awm tih in ring lo vem ni? In hnêna thu ka sawite hi keima phuahchawpin ka sawi lo. Pa, keimaha awm reng chuan ama hna a thawk a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei Paah ka awm a, Pa keimahah a awm ka tih hi ring rawh u; a nih loh leh thiltih avâng tal hian mi ring rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh mi ring chuan thil ka tih ang hi a ti ve ang; hei aia ropui zâwk pawh hi a la ti ang, Pa hnêna ka kal dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hminga eng pawh in dîl chuan ka ti zêl ang; Pa chu Fapa avânga chawimawi a nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hmingin eng pawh mi dîl chuan ka ti zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Nangnin mi hmangaih chuan, ka thupêkte in zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, keiin Pa ka dîl ang a, Awmpuitu dang a pe ang che u, in hnêna awm kumkhua tûrin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlarau dik tak, khawvêlin a hmuh lohva a hriat hek loh avânga a chan theih loh chu. Nangmahniah a nun avângin nangni chuan amah in hria e, in hnênah a awm reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fahrahin ka kalsan lo vang che u, in hnênah ka lo kal leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rei lo tê a chinah khawvêlin mi hmu tawh lo vang, nangni erawh chuan mi hmu ang, kei ka nun avângin nangni pawh in nung ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan kei Paa ka awm te, nangni keimaha in awm te, kei nangmahnia ka awm te in la hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu pawh ka thupêkte pawma zâwmtu chu mi hmangaihtu a ni; mi hmangaihtu chu ka Pain a hmangaih ang a, kei pawhin ka hmangaih ang a, a hnênah ka inlâr bawk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda, Iskariot ni lo zâwk chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, kan hnênah i inlâr ang a, khawvêl hnênah i inlâr si lo tûr chu engtizia nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Miin mi hmangaih chuan ka thu a zâwm ang, ka Pain ani chu a hmangaih ang a, a hnênah kan lo kal ang a, a hnênah kan awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi hmangaih lotu chuan ka thu a zâwm lo, thu in hriat hi keima thu a ni lo va, Pa mi tîrtu thu a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In hnêna ka la awm chhûng hian hêng thu hi ka hrilh che u a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Awmpuitu, Thlarau Thianghlim, ka hminga Pain a rawn tirh tûr chuan engkim a zirtîr ang che u, in hnêna ka sawi zawng zawng pawh a hriat chhuahtîr leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thlamuanna ka hnutchhiah a che u, keima thlamuanna ka pe a che u; khawvêlin a pêk ang ni lovin ka pêk che u hi. In thinlung mangang suh se, hlauh pawh hlau suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“‘Ka kal bo dâwn a, in hnênah ka lo kîr leh ang,’ ka tih kha in hria e. Mi hmangaih chuan Pa hnêna ka kal tûr hi in lâwm ang: Pa chu kei aiin a ropui zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu chu a lo thlen huna in rin theih nân, tûnah a lo thlen hmain ka hrilh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />In hnênah thu ka sawi tam tawh lo vang, he khawvêl lal hi a lo kal dâwn avângin. Ka chungah thu eng mah zawng a nei lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />amaherawhchu, keiin Pa ka hmangaih a, Pain thu mi pêk ang zêlin ka ti ṭhîn tih khawvêlin a hriatna tûr a ni. Tho rawh u, heta ta hi i chhuak ang u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kei hi grêp tak chu ka ni a, ka Pa a huan enkawltu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka zawmpui pêng rah lo apiang a paih ṭhîn a, a rah apiang a thian fai ṭhîn, a rah tam lehzual nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In hnêna ka thu sawi zawng zawng avâng chuan in thianghlim tawh pang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keimahah awm reng ula, kei pawh nangmahniah ka awm reng ang. Pêng chu grêp hruia a awm reng loh chuan a rah thei lo ang bawkin, nangni pawh keimaha in awm reng loh chuan in rah thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei grêp chu ka ni, nangni a pêngte chu in ni. Tu pawh keimaha awm renga, kei pawh amaha ka awm rengna chu tam takin a rah ṭhîn; keimah lovin eng mah in ti thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu pawh keimaha awm reng lo chu, pêng anga paih chhuahin an awm ṭhîn, pêng paih chu a vuai a, an fawm a, meiah an paih a, a kâng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimaha in awm renga, ka thu nangmahnia a awm reng bawk chuan, in duh apiang dîl ula, in hmu zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam taka in raha, ka zirtîrte in nih tak meuh hian ka Pa chawimawiin a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pain mi hmangaih angin kei pawhin ka hmangaih che u hi; ka hmangaihin awm reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thupêkte in zawm chuan, ka hmangaihin in awm reng ang, keiin ka Pa thupêkte ka zâwm a, a hmangaiha ka awm reng ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ka lâwmna hi nangmahnia a awm reng nân leh, in lâwmna chu a famkim nân hêng thu hi in hnênah ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hei hi ka thupêk chu a ni; ka hmangaih che u ang hian nangni pawh inhmangaih tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miin a ṭhian tân a nun a pêk aliama hmangaihna nasa zâwk tu man an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu ka pêk che u hi in tih chuan ka ṭhiante in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawih ka ti leh tawh lo vang che u; bawih chuan a pu thiltih a hre si lo va; ṭhiante ka ti zâwk a che u; ka Pa hnên aṭanga thil ka hriat zawng zawng ka hrilh tawh si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangnin mi thlang lo, keiman ka thlang zâwk che u a, va rah tûr leh in rah awm reng tûrin ka ruat bawk a che u; tichuan, ka hminga Pa hnêna in dîl apiang a pe dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He thu hi ka pe a che u, inhmangaih rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Khawvêlin a huat che u chuan, a huat hma che uin kei mi haw tawh tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khawvêl mi ni ula chuan, khawvêlin ama ta chu a hmangaih ang che u; nimahsela, khawvêl mi in ni lo va, khawvêla mi ka thlan chhuah in nih avângin khawvêlin a hua che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawih a pu aiin a ropui lo tih thu in hnêna ka sawi kha hre reng rawh u. Annin kei mi tihduhdah ang khân nangni pawh an tiduhdah ang che u; ka thu an zawm chuan in thu pawh an zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, hêng thil zawng zawng hi ka hming avângin in chungah an ti ang, mi tîrtu an hriat loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei lo kalin an hnênah thu sawi lo ila chuan, sual an nei lo tûr; tûnah zawng an sual chhuanlam tûr an nei tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh mi hua chuan ka Pa pawh a hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi dang tu ma la tih ngai loh thilte an zîngah ti lo ila chuan, sual an nei lo tûr; tûnah zawng ka thiltihte an hmu a, kei leh ka Pa chu min haw ta bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Engpawh ni se an Dân Lehkhabuah, ‘Annin a chhan awm lovin min hua,’ tih ziak kha a lo thlenna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Awmpuitu, Pa hnên ata in hnêna ka rawn tirh tûr, Paa chhuak Thlarau dik tak chu a lo thlen hunah, ani chuan ka chanchin a hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nangni pawh ka thu hretute in ni e, a tîr ata ka hnêna in awm avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“In tlûkchhiat loh nân hêng thu hi ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sunagog-ahte an hnawntîr ang che u a; a tihhlum che u apiangin Pathian duhzâwng tia an inngaih hun a lo la thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa leh kei mi hriat loh avângin chutiang thil chu an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hun a lo thlen tikah ka hrilh tawh che u tih in hriat reng nân hêng thu hi in hnênah ka sawi a ni e. “In hnêna ka la awm avângin a tîr ata hêng thu hi ka la hrilh lo rêng che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah chuan mi tîrtu hnênah ka kal dâwn tawh a, in zînga tu mahin, ‘Khawiah nge i kal dâwn?’ tiin mi zâwt si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mahse, hêng thu hi in hnênah ka han sawi ta a, in thinlung chu lungngaihnain a khat leh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Nimahsela, thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, ka kal hi in tân a ṭha zâwk e, ka kal loh chuan Awmpuitu chu in hnênah a lo kal dâwn si lo; ka kal erawh chuan in hnênah ka rawn tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chu a lo thlen chuan, sual thu te, thiam chantîrna thu te, rorêlna thu te an lo ngai sual tih khawvêl a hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sual thu-a an dik lohna chu kei mi rin lohna hi a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thiam chantîrna thu-a an dik lohna chu, Pa hnênah ka kal dâwn a, mi hmu leh dâwn tawh lo hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />rorêlna thu-a an dik lohna chu, he khawvêl rorêltu hi rorêlsakin a awm tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“In hnênah thu tam tak sawi tûr ka la nei cheu va; amaherawhchu, tûnah chuan in la tlin rih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlarau dik tak chu a lo thlen hunah erawh chuan thutak zawng zawngah a hruai lût ang che u. Ama phuahchawpin thu a sawi dâwn si lo; thu a dawn chu a sawi zâwk ang a, thil lo la thleng tûr pawh a hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan kei mi chawimawi ang; ka ta-a mi a la ang a, a hrilh dâwn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pain thil a neih zawng zawng ka ta a ni; chuvâng chuan a ni, ‘Ka ta-a mi lain a hrilh ang che u,’ ka tih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Rei lo têah nangnin mi hmu tawh lo vang a, rei lo têah bawk mi hmu leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A zirtîrte ṭhenkhatin, “Kan hnêna a thu sawi hi eng nge ni? ‘Rei lo têah mi hmu tawh lo vang a, rei lo têah bawk mi la hmu leh ang,’ a tih leh, ‘Pa hnêna ka kal dâwn avângin,’ a tih hi?” an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, “ ‘Rei lo tê,’ a tih hi eng tihna nge ni? Eng nge sawi a tum kan hre lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isuan thu an zâwt duh tih a hria a, an hnênah, “ ‘Rei lo têah mi hmu tawh lo vang a, rei lo têah bawk mi la hmu leh ang,’ ka tih kha in zâwt a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, nangni in mittui a tlain in ṭap ang a, khawvêl erawh chu an hlim ang; nangni in lungngai ang a; mahse, in lungngaih chu lâwmah a chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmeichhiain nau a neih dâwn chuan nasa takin a tuar a, a hun a thlen avângin; nimahsela, nau a lo pian chuan a tuarna chu a hre reng tawh ṭhîn lo, khawvêla mihring lo piang chu a lâwm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang chuan nangni pawh tûnah in lungngai a; nimahsela, ka hmu leh ang che u a, in thinlung a hlim ang a, in hlimna chu tu man an lâksak lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan nangnin eng mah mi zâwt tawh lo vang. Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u, Pa hnênah eng pawh in dîl chuan ka hmingin a pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tûn thleng hian ka hmingin eng mah in la dîl lo; dîl rawh u; tichuan, in hmu ang, in lâwm a kimna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Chûng chu a thawiin in hnênah ka sawi ṭhîn a; in hnênah pehhêla sawi tawh lovin, chiang taka Pa thu ka hrilh hun che u a lo thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan nangnin ka hmingin in dîl ang; keiin in tân Pa hnênah ka dîl ang ka ti lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pa ngei chuan a hmangaih si che u a, Pa hnên aṭanga lo kal ka ni tih in rin avângin mi hmangaih si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pa hnên aṭangin ka lo chhuak a, khawvêlah ka lo lût a, khawvêl ka chhuahsan leh dâwn a, Pa hnênah ka kal dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan, “Tûnah zawng chiang takin thu i sawi ta a, a thawiin i sawi ta lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Engkim i hria a, tu man an zawh che pawh i ngai lo tih tûnah chuan kan hre ta; hemi avâng hian Pathian hnên aṭanga lo kal i nih kan ring ta e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Tûnah in ring ta maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, nangni hi mahni in ṭheuhvah kal darhin, keimah chauhva mi thlah fâl hun a lo thleng dâwn, a thleng tawh mêk a ni; nimahsela, keimah chauhvin ka awm lo ve, Pa chu ka hnênah a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Keimahah thlamuanna in hmuh nân hêng hi in hnênah ka sawi a ni; khawvêlah hian hrehawmin in awm ṭhîn; nimahsela, thlamuang takin awm rawh u, keiin khawvêl ka ngam ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Isuan a sawi a, a vânvadâk a, “Ka Pa, a hun a thleng ta; i Fapa chawimawi rawh, Fapain a chawimawi theih nân che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng chunga thuneihna i pe ang khân ani pawhin a hnêna i pêk apiangte chu chatuan nun a pêk theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hei hi chatuan nunna chu a ni, nang Pathian tak chauh leh i tirh Isua Krista hriat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil tih tûr mi pêk kha ka ti zo va, leiah hian ka chawimawi tawh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka Pa, khawvêl awm hmaa i hnêna ropuina ka neih khân, tûnah nangma hnên ngeiah mi chawimawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Khawvêl ata kei mi pêkhote hnênah i hming ka tilang ta; i ta an ni a, anni chu mi pe a; i thu pawh an zâwm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûnah chuan thil mi pêk zawng zawng nangmaha chhuak a ni tih an hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangin thu mi pêkte kha an hnênah ka pe a, an lo pawm a; i hnên aṭanga lo kal ka ni ngei tih an hre ta bawk a, nangin kei mi tîr tih pawh an ring ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Keiin an tân ka ngensak hi, khawvêl tâna ngensak ka ni lo, nangin mi pêkte tân zâwk a ni, i ta an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ta zawng zawng chu i ta a ni a, i ta pawh chu ka ta a ni bawk e, anmahniah chawimawiin ka awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei khawvêlah ka awm tawh lo vang, anni erawh hi chu khawvêlah an la awm ang; kei zawng i hnênah ka lo haw dâwn ta. Ka Pa thianghlim, nangin mi pêkte hi i hmingin hum rawh, keimahni ang hian pumkhat an nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“An hnêna ka awm chhûng chuan nangin kei mi pêkte hi i hmingin ka hum ṭhîn; anni chu ka vêng a, an zînga pakhat mah an boral lo, boral tûra lo kha chu, Lehkha Thu a lo thlen kimna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tûnah i hnênah ka lo haw dâwn ta, hêng thil hi khawvêlah ka sawi a ni, ka lâwmna anmahniah an neih famkimna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I thu an hnênah ka pe tawh a, kei khawvêla mi ka ni lo ang bawk hian khawvêla mi an ni si lo va; chuvângin, khawvêlin an hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Anni chu khawvêl ata la chhuak tûrin ka ngên lo va che. Mi sual laka hum tûrin ka ngên zâwk a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khawvêl mi an ni lo, kei khawvêl mi ka ni lo ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anni chu thutakin tithianghlim rawh, i thu chu thutak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawvêla mi tîr angin anni pawh khawvêlah ka tirh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anmahni avângin ka intithianghlim a ni, anni pawh thutaka an thianghlimna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hêngho tân chauh hian ngensak ka ni lo, an thu avânga kei mi la ring tûrte tân pawh ngensak ka ni bawk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an za-in inpumkhat sela; ‘Ka Pa, nang keimahah i awma, kei nangmaha ka awm ang hian, anni pawh keimahniah awm sela, nangin kei mi tîr tih khawvêlin an rin theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangin ropuina mi pêk kha kei pawhin anni ka pe ta, pumkhat an nih theih nân, keini pumkhat kan ni ang bawk hian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kei anmahniah, nang keimahah, an inpumkhatna a famkim nân leh, nangin kei mi tîr a, mi hmangaih ang bawkin anni chu i hmangaih tih khawvêlin an hriat nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka Pa, nangin mi pêkte hi ka awmnaa ka hnêna awmah ka duh, nangin mi hmangaih avânga leilung pian hma tawha mi pêk ka ropuina kha an hmuhna tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ka Pa fel tak, khawvêl zawngin an hre lo che a, kei erawh chuan ka hria a che; hêngho pawh hian nangin kei mi tîr tih an hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An hnênah i hming ka hriattîr a, ka hriattîr zêl ang; hmangaihna, keimah min hmangaihna ngei kha anmahnia a awma, kei anmahnia ka awm theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isuan chûng thu chu a sawi zawhin, a zirtîrte nên an chhuak a, Kidron luikawr an kân a, chutah chuan huan a awm a, a chhûngah chuan a zirtîrte nên an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mantîrtu Juda pawh chuan chu hmun chu a hria, chutah chuan Isua leh a zirtîrte an inhmuh fo ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda chuan sipai pâwl khat leh puithiam lalte leh Farisai-te tirh Tempul vêngtute chutah chuan a rawn hruai a; khâwnvâr te, meichher te, hriamhrei te an keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isuan a chunga thil lo thleng tûr zawng zawng chu a hre vek a; a va pên chhuak a, an hnênah, “Tu nge in zawn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nazaret Isua,” tiin an lo chhâng a. Isuan, “Keimah hi ka ni,” a ti a. A mantîrtu Juda pawh chu an zîngah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, “Keimah hi ka ni,” an hnêna a tih veleh, an hnungtawlh a, leiah an tlu hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tu nge in zawn?” tiin anni chu a zâwt leh a, “Nazaret Isua,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Keimah hi ka ni tih ka hrilh tawh che u alâwm, kei mi zawng in nih chuan hêngho hi thlah ṭha rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thu sawi, “Nangin kei mi pêkte kha pakhat mah ka hloh lo,” a tih kha a lo thlen theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simon Petera chuan a khandaih a phawi a, Puithiam lalber bawih a sât a, a beng ding lam a hlawisak a. Chu bawih hming chu Malka a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isuan Petera hnênah chuan, “Khandaih kha a paiah khung rawh; Pain mi pêk no hi ka in lo vang em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, sipai pâwl leh an hotu leh Juda-te Tempul vêngtuho infin khâwm chuan Isua chu an man a, an phuar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anna hmaah an hruai hmasa a. Anna chu, chumi kuma Puithiam lalber Kaiafa puzawn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaiafa chu a ni, ‘Mipui thih aiin mi pakhat thih a ṭha zâwk,’ tia Juda-te thu râwntu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simon Petera leh zirtîr dang pakhatin Isua chu an zui a. Chu zirtîr chu Puithiam lalber hmêlhriat a ni a. Puithiam lalber kawtlaiah chuan Isua a luhpui ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Petera erawh chu kawngka pâwn lamah a ding a. Zirtîr dang, Puithiam lalber hmêlhriat chu, a va chhuak a, kawngka vêngtu nula chu a bia a, Petera chu a hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kawngka vêngtu nula chuan Petera hnênah, “Nang pawh he mi zirtîrte zînga mi i ni lâwm ni?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutah chuan chhiahhlawhte leh vêngtu sipaite an ding a, a vawh avângin meihawlin mei an chhêm a, an ai hlawm a; Petera pawh chuan an zîngah mei lum chu a ai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiam lalber chuan Isua chu a zirtîrte chanchin leh a thu zirtîr chungchâng a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isuan ani chu a chhâng a, “A langin mi tin hnênah thu ka sawi ṭhîn; Juda zawng zawng kal khâwmna sunagog-ah te, Tempulah te ka zirtîr fo ṭhîn a; a rûkin eng mah ka sawi ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engah nge kei mi zawh? Ka thu sawi ngaithlatute hnênah eng nge ka sawi ṭhin zâwt ta che u, eng nge ka sawi an hria alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawh chuan vêngtu sipai dingho zînga pakhat chuan Isua hmaiah a bêng a, “Chutianga Puithiam lalber chhân tûr em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan ani chu a chhâng a, “Thu dik lo ka sawi a nih chuan mi hrilh mai la, thu dik ka sawi si chuan engah nge mi ben?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anna chuan phuar chungin Puithiam lalber hnênah a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simon Petera chuan dingin mei lum a la ai a, “Nang pawh hi a zirtîrte zînga mi i ni lo maw?” an ti a. Ani chuan a phat a, “Ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Puithiam lalber chhiahhlawhte zînga pakhat, Peteran a beng a hlawisaka laichîn chuan, “Huanah khân a hnênah ka hmu lo che maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Petera chuan a phat leh a; tin âr a khuang ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isua chu Kaiafa in aṭangin Ramawptu inah an hruai a. Zîng tak a la ni a. Juda-te chu bawlhhlawh lova Kalhlên Kût chaw an ei theih nân a inah chuan an lût duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilata chu an hnênah a va chhuak a, “He mi hi eng tisualah nge in puh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anni chuan, “He mi hian thil sual a tih loh chuan i hnênah kan rawn hruai lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pilatan, “Nangmahniin hruai ula, in dân angin a thu rêlsak ta che u,” a ti a. Juda-te chuan, “Keini chuan mi tihhlum theihna kan nei hlei nêm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chu chu Isuan engtianga thi tûr nge a nih a sawina thu a lo thlenna tûrin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilata chu a inah a lût leh a, Isua a ko va, a hnênah, “Juda-te lal i ni maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Chu chu nangma rilru puak chhuaka sawi nge i nih, mi dangin ka chungchâng thu hi an hrilh che?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilatan a chhâng a, “Kei hi Juda ka ni em ni? I chipuite leh puithiam lalten ka hnênah an rawn hlân che a nih hi; eng nge i tih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Ka ram chu he khawvêla mi hi a ni lo; ka ram chu he khawvêla mi ni sela, Juda-te kuta mantîra ka awm loh nân ka ṭhuihruaiten an bei ang; ka ram zawng heta mi a ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pilatan, “Chu, lal i ni maw?” a ti a. Isuan a chhâng a, “Nangman lal mi ti a; kei chu thutak hriattîr hi ka pian chhan leh khawvêla ka lo kal chhan chu a ni. Tu pawh thutaka awm chuan ka aw an ngaithla ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pilatan a hnênah, “Thutak eng nge ni?” a ti a. Chu chu a sawi zawhin Juda-te hnênah a va chhuak leh a, an hnênah, “A chungah thu pawi eng mah ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, in tih ṭhin dânin Kalhlên Kût laiin mi tâng pakhat ka chhuahsak dâwn che u a, Juda-te lal hi chhuahsak che u ila in duh em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, ring takin an au va, “He mi hi chu ni lo ve, Barabba zâwk le,” an ti a. Barabba chu suamhmang a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Pilatan Isua a hruai a, a vuaktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sipaite chuan chawimawi nân hlîng an kual a, lukhumah an khumtîr a, kawrfual senduk an hâktîr bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Chibai, Juda-te lal!” an ti a; a hmaiah an bêng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pilata chu pâwnah a va chhuak leh a, an hnênah, “En teh u, a chungah eng mah thu pawi ka hmu lo tih in hriat nân in hnênah ka rawn hruai chhuah hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, chawimawina lukhum chu khuma kawrfual senduk ha chuan Isua chu pâwnah a lo chhuak a. Tin, an hnênah, “En teh u, Mihringa hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh an ṭhuihruaiten an hmuh chuan, “Krawsah khêngbet rawh, krawsah khêngbet rawh,” tiin an au va. Pilatan an hnênah, “Nangmahnin hruai ula, krawsah khêngbet ta che u, kei zawngin a chungah thu pawi ka hmu lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda-te chuan an chhâng a, “Dân kan nei a, chumi dân ang chuan, Pathian Fapaa a inchhâl avângin a thi tûr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilatan chu thu chu a hriatin a hlau lehzual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inah a va lût leh a, Isua hnênah, “Khawi lam mi nge i nih?” a ti a. Nimahsela, Isuan a chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pilatan a hnênah, “Nangin kei mi be duh lo vei maw? Chhuah thei che ka ni a, krawsa khêngbet thei che ka ni tih i hre lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Chung lam aṭanga pêk i nih loh chuan ka chungah thuneihna rêng rêng i nei lo vang; chuvângin, i hnêna mi petu khân sual a phur nasa zâwk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Pilatan amah chhuah dân kawng a zawng ta a; nimahsela, Juda-te an au va, “He mi hi i chhuah chuan Kaisara ṭhian i ni lo vang; tu pawh lala insiam chu Kaisara do an ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilatan chûng thu chu a hriat chuan Isua chu a hruai chhuak a, ‘Lungrem,’ Hebrai ṭawng chuan, ‘Gabatha,’ an tih, rorêlna ṭhutthlêngah chuan a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kalhlên Kût Inrinni a ni a, chhûn lai vêl a ni. Juda-te hnênah chuan, “En teh u, in lal hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anni chu an au va, “Tiboral rawh, tiboral rawh; krawsah khêngbet rawh,” an ti a. Pilatan, “In lal hi krawsah ka khêngbet ang maw?” a ti a. Puithiam lalten an chhâng a, “Kaisara lo chu lal dang kan nei lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu krawsa khenbeh tûrin a pe ta a. Chutichuan, Isua chu an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahni kraws puin, ‘Luruh hmun,’ Hebrai ṭawnga, ‘Golgotha,’ an tih hmun chu, panin a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutah chuan krawsah an khêngbet a, mi dang pahnih nên, a sîr tuakah pakhat ve vein, a laiah Isua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pilata chuan hriattîrna a ziak a, kraws lêrah a târ a, “Nazaret Isua, Juda-te lal,” tia ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hriattîrna chu Juda tam takin an chhiar a, Isua an khenbehna hmun chu khawpui kiang a nih avângin Hebrai ṭawng te, Rom ṭawng te, Grik ṭawng tein ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Juda puithiam lalte chuan Pilata hnênah, “ ‘Juda-te lal,’ tiin ziak suh, ‘Juda-te lal ka ni a ti,’ tiin ziak zâwk rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilatan a chhâng a, “Ka ziak kha ka ziak zo tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sipaiten Isua krawsa an khenbeh zawh chuan a silhfênte an lâksak a, sipai pakhat tân chan khat zêl tûrin chan li-ah an sem a. A kawrfual an la bawk a, chu chu ṭhui loh kawr a ni a, a nghâwng aṭanga a tlâng thlengin a pumin tah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hei hi chu i pawt thlêr suh ang u, tu ta ber tûr nge hriat nân ṭhum i vâwr zâwk ang u,” an ti a, “Ka silhfênte an insem a, Ka kawr atân ṭhum an vâwr a,” tih Lehkha Thu kha a lo thlenna tûrin. Sipaihote chuan chûng chu an ti ta ngei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isua kraws kiangah chuan a nu te, a nu laizâwn Mari, Klopa nupui te, Mari Magdala mi te an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isuan a nu leh a kianga ding zirtîr a hmangaih chu a hmuhin a nu hnênah chuan, “Ka nu, en teh, i fapa kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zirtîr hnênah pawh chuan, “En teh, i nu kha,” a ti a. Chuta ṭang chuan chu zirtîr chuan ama inah ani chu a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Isuan thil zawng zawng a thleng kim ta tih a hria a; Lehkha Thu a thlen nân, “Ka tui a hal e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutah chuan bêl, uain thûra khat a awm a; tichuan, sponj, uain thûra an chiah chu, husop tiangah an târ a, a hmui an han thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isuan uain thûr chu a lo in zawh chuan, “A kim ta!” a ti a; tin, a lu a kûn a, a hnuk a chat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Juda-te Inrinni a ni a, ruangte chu sabat nia krawsa a awm reng loh nân, chu sabat chu ni ropui a ni si a, Juda-te chuan Pilata hnênah mi khenbehho kête tihtliaha, an ruang lâk sawn an dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutichuan, sipaite an lo kal a, Isua ruala khenbehte, a tawn tirha mi leh pakhat zâwk kête chu an titliak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Isua an va pan a, a thi tawh tih an hria a, a kête chu an tihtliahsak ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, sipai zînga pakhat chuan a nâkah feiin a chhun a, thisen leh tui a lo luang chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mit ngeia hmutu sawi a ni, nangni pawhin in rinna tûrin. A thu hriattîr hi a dik a, thu dik a sawi tih hretu pakhat a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lehkha Thu, “A ruh pakhat mah tihtliah a ni lo vang,” tih thlenna tûra chûng thil chu lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lehkha Thu dangin, “An chhuna chu an la en ang,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Arimathai khaw mi Josefa, Isua zirtîr, Juda-te a hlauh avânga inthup chuan, Pilata chu Isua ruang lâk a dîl a. Pilatan a lo phalsak a. Tichuan, a ruang chu a va la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nikodema, tûn hmaa zâna a hnêna lo kal kha, mura leh aloe inpawlh sa Kg. sawmthum leh pali lai kengin a lo kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An pahnih chuan Isua ruang chu an la a, Juda-te inphûm dân angin englo rimtuite nên chuan puan zai sînin an zem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amah an khenbehna hmunah chuan huan a awm a; huanah chuan thlân thar, tu mah an la zalh ngai lohna a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Juda-te Inrinni a nih avângin, thlân chu an kiang lawka awm a ni bawk a, Isua chu an zalh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathianni zîng takah, khua a la thim laiin, Magdala mi Mari chu thlânah chuan a va kal a, lung chu thlân ata lâk sawnin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Simon Petera leh zirtîr dang Isuan a hmangaih hnênah chuan a va tlân a, an hnênah, “Thlân ata Lalpa chu an la chhuak a, khawiah nge an dah kan hre si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Petera leh zirtîr dang chu thlân lam panin an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An pahnih chuan an tlân dûn a; zirtîr dang chu Petera aiin a tlân chak zâwk a, thlân chu a thleng hmasa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kûnin a han bih a, puan zai sîn awmte chu a hmu a, a chhûngah erawh chuan a lût lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Simon Petera pawh a hnungah a lo thleng ve a, thlân chhûngah chuan a lût ta a; puan zai sîn awmte chu a hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a lu tuamna puan pawh chu puan zai sîn zînga awm lovin, inziala a hranga awmin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zirtîr dang, thlân thleng hmasa pawh chu a lût ve ta a, a hmu a, a ring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mitthi zîng ata a tholeh tûr a ni tih Lehkha Thu kha an la hrethiam rih si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, zirtîrte chu an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mari chu thlân pâwnah ṭap chungin a ding a. Ṭap chung chuan a kûn a, thlân chhûng chu a han bih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isua ruang awmna a lu leh a ke bulah vântîrhkoh pahnih, a vâra inthuam, ṭhu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, engati nge i ṭah?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Ka Lalpa an la bo va, an dahna ka hre lo atin a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawh chuan a han lehhawi a, Isua ding a hmu a, Isua a ni tih erawh chu a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, engati nge i ṭah? Tu nge i zawn?” a ti a. Ani chuan huan enkawltu emaw a ti a, a hnênah, “Ka pu, amah i la bo a nih chuan i dahna mi hrilh ta che; tichuan, ka la dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Mari!” a ti a. Ani chuan a lam a han hawi a, Hebrai ṭawngin, “Rabboni,” a ti a (chu chu, ‘Zirtîrtu,’ tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Mi vuan tawh suh, Pa hnênah pawh ka la chhoh rih loh hi; amaherawhchu, ka unaute hnênah va kal la, an hnênah, ‘Ka Pa, in Pa, ka Pathian, in Pathian hnênah ka chho dâwn,’ a ti e, ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mari, Magdala mi chu, a kal ta a, zirtîrte hnênah, “Lalpa chu ka hmu ta,” a va ti a, chûng thu chu a hnênah a sawi tih a hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi ni, Pathianni tlaiah chuan, Juda-te hlauh avângin zirtîrte awmna kawngkhârte chu an khâr tawh a, Isua a lo kal a, an zîngah a lo ding a, an hnênah, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi a sawi zawh chuan a kut leh a nâk a entîr a, Lalpa chu an hmuh chuan zirtîrte chu an lâwm êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An hnênah, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” a ti leh a. “Pain kei mi tîr ang bawkin kei pawhin ka tirh che u hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi zawhin an chungah a thaw a, an hnênah, “Thlarau Thianghlim nei rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu sual pawh in ngaihdam chu ngaihdam a ni ang a, in ngaihdam loh chu ngaihdam loh a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sâwmpahnihte zînga pakhat, Thoma, Phîra an tih chu, Isua lo kal laiin an zîngah a awm ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zirtîr dangte chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa chu kan hmu ta asin,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “A kuta thîr khenna hmuamhma ka hmuha, thîr khenna hmuamhmaahte ka kut zunga ka khawiha, a nâk ka zen ngei loh chuan ka awih lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni riat hnuah a zirtîrte chu in chhûngah an awm khâwm leh a, Thoma pawh an zîngah a awm ve a. Kawngkhârte chu kalh a ni a; mahse, Isua a lo kal a, an zîngah a lo ding a, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Thoma hnênah chuan, “I kut zungṭang chuan han khawih la, ka kutte en rawh, han ban la, ka nâk zen rawh; ring lovin awm suh la, ring mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thoman a chhâng a, “Ka Lalpa leh ka Pathian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Mi hmuh avângin mi ring a ni maw? Hmu lova ringte chu an nihlawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isuan zirtîrte hmaah chuan chhinchhiahna thil mak dang tam tak a ti a, chûng chu he lehkhabuah hian ziak a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Isua chu Krista, Pathian Fapa a ni tih in rinna tûr leh, in rin avâng chuan ama hminga nun in neih nân hêng hi ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Isua chu Tiberia dîlah a zirtîrte hnênah a inlâr leh a; hetiang hian a inlâr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Simon Petera te, Thoma - Phîra an tih te, Galili rama Kana khuaa mi Nathanaela te, Zebedaia fapa pahnih te, a zirtîr zînga pahnih dang te an awm khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simon Petera chuan an hnênah, “Sangha man tûrin ka kal dâwn e,” a ti a. Anni chuan “Keini pawh i hnênah kan kal ve ang,” an ti a. An thawk chhuak a, lawngah an chuang ta a; mahse, chumi zân chuan eng mah an man lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua a lo vâr chuan Isua chu ṭiauphovah a lo ding a; nimahsela, zirtîrte chuan Isua a ni tih an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Naute u, in man em?” a ti a. Anni chuan “Man hauh lo mai,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan “Lawng sîr ding lamah khân lên dêng ula, in man ang,” a ti a. Tichuan, an han dêng a, sangha a tam avângin an hnûk chhuak zo ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zirtîr, Isuan a hmangaiha khân Petera hnênah, “Lalpa a nih saw!” a ti a. Simon Peteran Lalpa a ni tih a hriat chuan kawr a inbel a, saruakin a lo awm si a, dîlah chuan a zuang thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zirtîr dangte erawh chuan lawng têin, lên, sanghaa khat hnûk chung chuan an rawn pan a, khawmual aṭanga hla lo tê, tawng zahnih emaw lekah an awm a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawmuala an chhuah chuan, meihawla mei chhêm, a chunga sangha awm leh chhang chu an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Tûna in sangha man kha a ṭhen han la teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Simon Petera chu lawngah a va chuang a, lên chu sangha lian pui puia khatin khawmualah a hnûk chhuak a, za leh sawmnga leh pathum a ni; chuti zo zai chu awm mah sela lên chu a ṭet si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Tûkṭhuan lo ei rawh u,” a ti a. Zirtîrte zînga tu mahin, “Tu nge i nih?” tiin an zâwt ngam lo. Lalpa a ni tih an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isua chu a kal a, chhang a la a, an hnênah a pe a, sangha pawh chutiang bawkin a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu chu Isua mitthi zîng ata a thawhleh hnua a inlâr vawi thumna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûkṭhuan an ei kham chuan, Isuan Simon Petera hnênah, “Simon, Johana fapa, hêngte ai hian nangin mi hmangaih zâwk em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Aw, Lalpa, ka ngaina che tih i hria e,” a ti a. Isuan a hnênah, “Ka berâm note châwm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A vawi hnihnaah chuan Isuan a hnênah, “Simon, Johana fapa, nangin mi hmangaih em?” a ti leh a. Ani chuan, “Aw, Lalpa, ka ngaina che tih i hria e,” a ti a. Isuan, “Ka berâmte enkawl rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A vawi thumnaah chuan a hnênah, “Simon, Johana fapa, nangin mi ngaina em?” a ti a. A vawi thumnaah, “Mi ngaina em?” a hnêna a tih avâng chuan Petera a lungngai a, “Lalpa, engkim i hria a, ka ngaina che tih i hria e,” a ti a. Isuan a hnênah, “Ka berâmte châwm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thu dik tak ka hrilh a che, i naupan laiin incheiin i kâwng i hrêng a, i duhna apiangah i lêng ṭhîn a, i lo upat hnuah erawh chuan i kutte i phar ang a, mi dangin i kâwng an hrênsak ang chia, i duh lohna lamah an hruai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Engtianga thiin nge Pathian a la chawimawi ang tih hriat nân chûng thu chu a sawi a ni; chu chu a sawi zawhin a hnênah, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Petera chu a han lehhawi a, zirtîr, Isuan a hmangaih, zanriah ei laia a âwm nghênga thle pheia, “Lalpa, a mantîrtu tûr che chu tu nge ni?” titu khân rawn zuiin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani chu Peteran a han hmuh chuan, Isua hnênah, “Lalpa, ani saw engtin nge ni dâwn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Ka lo kal leh thlenga awm reng tûrin duh pawh ni ila, eng atân nge i tih? Mi zui mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu zirtîr chu thi lo tûr angin unaute zîngah chuan thu a thang vêl ta a. Nimahsela, Isuan a thi lo vang tih a hnênah a sawi si lo, ‘Ka lo kal leh thlenga awm reng tûrin duh pawh ni ila, eng atân nge i tih?’ a ti mai zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chu zirtîr chu hêng thu hretu leh ziaktu hi a ni a, a thu hriattîr hi a dik a ni tih kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thil dang tam tak Isuan a tihte a la awm a, chûng chu ziak chhuah vek ni dâwn sela, lehkhabu ziak tûr chu khawvêlah pawh hian lengin ka ring lo.
  </para>
</usx>
